<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PRO" style="id">- Kwere Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Simwe</para>
  <para style="toc1">Simwe za Ubala</para>
  <para style="toc2">Simwe</para>
  <para style="toc3">Sim</para>
  <para style="mt">SIMWE ZA UBALA</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Simwe za Ubala ni kuilumba kwa nongezi za ubala. Chitabu chino chandikigwa na wanhu wengi, mbali Sulemani mwana wa mfalume Daudi niiyo yandike simwe nyingi ng'hani. Mfalume Sulemani kamanyika kwa ubala wake. Chitabu cha 1 Wafalume 4:32 chomtambula Sulemani kuwa katunga simwe 3,000. Ivo simwe nyingi za ubala zandikigwa chipindi cha ugima wa mfalume Sulemani hagati ya mwaka 1,000 KK mbaka mwaka 900 KK. Simwe zimwenga zandikigwa na kulumbilizigwa muna ichipindi cha mfalume Hezekia yakalile kotawala isi ya Yuda kwandusila mwaka 715 KK mbaka mwaka 686 KK (Simwe sula ya 25:1).</para>
  <para style="ip">Simwe za ubala ni nongezi zili na ukweli kwa wanhu wengi, mbali zili mbasakanyo na mbuli zimwenga za Bibiliya zili vilagano hebu ulotezi. Simwe sula ya 22:6 yolonga kuwa wana waleligwe vinogile wezatenda mbuli zinogile mbaka vondawakule. Simwe ino hailava chilagano kuwa habule mbuli yoyose ihile yondaimpate mwana yaleligwe vinogile. Mbali miyanza mingi yolagusa ukweli. Chitabu chenyewo cholonga lungilo jake muna isula ya 1:2-6. Lungilo jake kuwataza wabwanga welibule umanyi wapate kuwa na ubala, iviya kuwatenda wanhu weli na ubala wavimanye ng'hani.</para>
  <para style="iot">Mbuli zili muna Ichitabu cha Simwe za Ubala</para>
  <para style="io">1. Sula ya 1 mbaka sula ya 22:16 zina simwe za Sulemani.</para>
  <para style="io">2. Sula ya 22:17 mbaka sula ya 24 zina mabumbila maidi ya kuilumba kwa simwe za wanhu weli na ubala.</para>
  <para style="io">3. Sula ya 25 mbaka sula ya 29 kuilumba kwa simwe zimwenga za Sulemani. Simwe izo ziduganyigwa na wasang'hani wa mfalume Hezekia.</para>
  <para style="io">4. Sula ya 30 ina simwe za Aguli.</para>
  <para style="io">5. Sula ya 31:1-9 ina simwe za Lamueli.</para>
  <para style="io">6. Kuuhelelo sula ya 31:10-31 yolonga kusonhela muke yeli na moyo unogile.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PRO 1" />
  <para style="s">Masimwe yofaya kufundiza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 1:1" />Yano yayo masimwe ya Sulemani mwana wa Daudi, mfalume wa Isilaili. <verse eid="PRO 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 1:2" />Masimwe yano yowafundiza wanhu ubala na yowafundiza kuyamanya mafundizo yanogile. <verse eid="PRO 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 1:3" />Masimwe yano yofaya kuwafundiza wanhu kuigaza muladi watende mbuli zinogile na watende mbuli zigoloke na bila ya kuwonela. <verse eid="PRO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 1:4" />Yano yofaya kuwatenda wanhu wabozi hawavimanyile wawe wabala na kuwatenda wabwanga wavimanye na waiteganye. <verse eid="PRO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 1:5" />Wabala wategeleze na waiyohe kuvimanya, iviya wanhu weli na nzewele waifunze. <verse eid="PRO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 1:6" />Chitabu chino chofaya kuwafundiza wanhu wavimanye simwe na vitendawili na mbuli za wabala na simo.<verse eid="PRO 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 1:7" />Uhalonda ubala wanduse kumdumba Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:7">wabozi watatali wolema kuzumigwa na mafundizo.<verse eid="PRO 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Munhu sekeyailumbe na wahasanyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 1:8" />Mwanangu, tegeleza tati yako viyokuzuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:8">na sekeuleme mafundizo ya mami yako.<verse eid="PRO 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 1:9" />Yayo yezakuwa kombelo dinogile muna iditwi jako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:9">na mkufu wa kuihamba muna isingo yako.<verse eid="PRO 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 1:10" />Mwanangu, one wahasanyi wahakusongeza, sekeutogole.<verse eid="PRO 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 1:11" />Wezalonga, “Izo wiilumbe na cheye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:11">chikawasepe wanhu chiwakome.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:11">Izo chikawasepe wanhu welibule ubananzi.<verse eid="PRO 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 1:12" />Chiwakome muladi isi iwamele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:12">wezakuwa fana wanhu waja wohulumuka muna dikombo.<verse eid="PRO 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 1:13" />Chizasola vinhu vawo vose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:13">iviya chizamemeza kaye zetu vinhu vichihokile.<verse eid="PRO 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 1:14" />One uhailumba na cheye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:14">vinhu vose chizaigolela.”<verse eid="PRO 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 1:15" />Mwanangu, sekeuwasondelele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:15">na sekeutende viwotenda wawo.<verse eid="PRO 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 1:16" />Kwaviya migulu yawo yokimbilila kutenda uhasanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:16">wahuha kuwakoma wanhu.<verse eid="PRO 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 1:17" />Haifaya kutega lwavu, kuno ndege wokuwona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:17">mtego uwo wotegigwa bule.<verse eid="PRO 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 1:18" />Mbali wanhu wano woikoma wenyewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:18">woisepa wawo wenyewo.<verse eid="PRO 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 1:19" />Uno niuwo uhelelo wa wanhu wose wopata vinhu kwa nzila haifaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:19">wousegeza ugima uweli nawo wenyewo.<verse eid="PRO 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Munhu mbala kowazuma wanhu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 1:20" />Ubala ulinga fana muke yotanga kwa dizi kulu muna dikulugumbi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:20">kolandula dizi jake muna yamabuga.<verse eid="PRO 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 1:21" />Kolila kuna ulung'husesa lwa wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:21">kolonga mbuli zake hanhu ha kwingilila muna dibululu.<verse eid="PRO 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 1:22" />“Mweye hamvimanyile, vino mwizaunanahila ubozi wenu mbaka zuwaki?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:22">Mweye mukwinzikila, vino mwizadeng'helela kwinzikila mbaka zuwaki?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:22">Mweye wabozi, vino mwizakwihila umanyi mbaka zuwaki?<verse eid="PRO 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 1:23" />Vinimzumani musame,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:23">nizamulongelani chili muumoyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:23">na nizamulongelani mbuli zangu.<verse eid="PRO 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 1:24" />Vinimtangileni mulema kunitegeleza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:24">na habule yoyose yalolile vinigolose mkono wangu kumtangani.<verse eid="PRO 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 1:25" />Muzehula mbuli zangu zose zonimulongeleni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:25">na hamulondile nimzumeni.<verse eid="PRO 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 1:26" />Vondamugaye, nizamsekani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:26">vondamudumbe, nizamzehani.<verse eid="PRO 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 1:27" />Nizamzehani vondayamwizileni magayo na mahulo fana beho kulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:27">iviya nizamzehani vondamuzoligwe na ndilo fana vulavumbi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:27">iviya nizamzehani vondamupatigwe na uzidilwa na manhesa.<verse eid="PRO 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 1:28" />Baho mwizanitanga, mbali sizamwidikani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:28">mwizanizahila mbali hamwizaniwona<verse eid="PRO 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 1:29" />kwaviya mulema kuvimanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:29">na hamusagule kumdumba Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="PRO 1:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 1:30" />Iviya mulema mbuli zangu zose zonimulongeleni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:30">na hamulondile nimzumeni.<verse eid="PRO 1:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 1:31" />Mwizakuja matunda ya nzila zenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:31">na mwizavimbilwa na matunda ya ubananzi wenu wenyewo.<verse eid="PRO 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 1:32" />Kwaviya wabozi wezakomigwa kwa udugi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:32">na wezanangigwa kwa kwehula nzila zigoloke.<verse eid="PRO 1:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 1:33" />Mbali wanhu wose wonitegeleza, wezakala vinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 1:33">wezakala goya na hawadumba mbuli zihile.”<verse eid="PRO 1:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PRO 2" />
  <para style="s">Gweko da ubala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 2:1" />Mwanangu, uzitogole mbuli zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 2:1">na uzike goya ndagilizi zangu muna umoyo wako.<verse eid="PRO 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 2:2" />Tegeleza mbuli za ubala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 2:2">na uiyohe kuvimanya.<verse eid="PRO 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 2:3" />Ulonde kusagula vinhu vinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 2:3">na upule udahi wa kuvimanya.<verse eid="PRO 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 2:4" />Uzahile ubala fana viuzahila hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 2:4">iviya fana viuzahila ngama ifisigwe.<verse eid="PRO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 2:5" />Kwa kutenda ivo, kwizavimanya kumdumba Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 2:5">na kummanya yeye.<verse eid="PRO 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 2:6" />Kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kowatenda wanhu wawe na ubala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 2:6">kwa mbuli zake, kowatenda wanhu wavimanye na wawe na nzewele.<verse eid="PRO 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 2:7" />Mulungu kowataza wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 2:7">na kowamila wanhu welibule ubananzi.<verse eid="PRO 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 2:8" />Kwaviya Mulungu kowakaliza goya wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 2:8">na kowakaliza goya wanhu wake wokwaminika.<verse eid="PRO 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 2:9" />Uhanitegeleza, kwizavimanya kutenda mbuli zinogile na zigoloke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 2:9">iviya kwizavimanya kuwinza inhululika bila ya kuwonela.<verse eid="PRO 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 2:10" />Kwaviya muna umoyo wako kwizakuwa na ubala na kwizadeng'helela.<verse eid="PRO 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 2:11" />Vondausagule vinhu vinogile kwizakala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 2:11">na umanyi wizakukaliza.<verse eid="PRO 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 2:12" />Uhawa na ubala hwizatenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 2:12">na hwizatogola mbuli ziwolonga wavwizi.<verse eid="PRO 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 2:13" />Wanhu wano woleka kutenda mbuli zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 2:13">wogenda muna inzila ili na ziza totolo.<verse eid="PRO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 2:14" />Wodeng'helela kutenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 2:14">na wonogelwa na wihi.<verse eid="PRO 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 2:15" />Wowavwizila wamwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 2:15">na wolonga uvwizi.<verse eid="PRO 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 2:16" />Uhawa mbala kodaha kumkimbila mwanamke malaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 2:16">yowanogeza walume kwa mbuli zake zilimulile.<verse eid="PRO 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 2:17" />Komuleka mulume yamsolile yang'hali mhambe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 2:17">na kodizeha lagano dowekile haulongozi wa Mulungu wake.<verse eid="PRO 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 2:18" />Uhengila muikaye ya mwanamke malaya kokwaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 2:18">kwaviya nzila yake yohita kuzimu.<verse eid="PRO 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 2:19" />Wanhu wose wohita kumwake hawabwela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 2:19">na hawafika kuna uugima.<verse eid="PRO 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 2:20" />Usondelele simwe da wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 2:20">na ukale fana viwokala wanhu welile.<verse eid="PRO 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 2:21" />Kwaviya wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile, wezakala muna iisi yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 2:21">na wezagendelela kukala uko siku nyingi.<verse eid="PRO 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 2:22" />Mbali wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wezabaguligwa na isi yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 2:22">na wanhu hawaminika wezang'oligwa.<verse eid="PRO 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PRO 3" />
  <para style="s">Faida ya ubala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 3:1" />Mwanangu, sekeuzimize mafundizo yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:1">uyazindilile malagilizo yangu.<verse eid="PRO 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 3:2" />Malagilizo yayo yezakongezela siku nyingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:2">na kwizatemeligwa mate siku zose za ugima wako.<verse eid="PRO 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 3:3" />Ulondo wa kufunya umoyo na waminika sekeviilekese na weye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:3">vifunge muna isingo yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:3">na uvandike muna umoyo wako.<verse eid="PRO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 3:4" />Maabaho kwizatogoligwa na kwizatangigwa munhu yanogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:4">haulongozi wa Mulungu na haulongozi wa wanhu.<verse eid="PRO 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 3:5" />Muhuwile Mndewa Mulungu kwa moyo wako wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:5">iviya sekeuhuwile nzewele zako mwenyewo.<verse eid="PRO 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 3:6" />Chila mbuli youtenda, muleke yeye yakulongoze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:6">na kezagolosa nzila zako.<verse eid="PRO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 3:7" />Sekeugese kuwa weye mbala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:7">mdumbe Mndewa Mulungu na sekeutende mbuli zihile.<verse eid="PRO 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 3:8" />Iyo izakutenda ugangamale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:8">na iyo izakutenda unenehe.<verse eid="PRO 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 3:9" />Muhishimu Mndewa Mulungu kwa kumwing'ha vinhu vako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:9">na kumwing'ha malimbulo ya mazao yako yose.<verse eid="PRO 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 3:10" />Maabaho madungu yako yezamema ndiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:10">na ng'hupulilo zako zizamema divai ya sambi.<verse eid="PRO 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 3:11" />Mwanangu, sekeuleme kulamuligwa na Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:11">na sekeuleme kuzumigwa nayo.<verse eid="PRO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 3:12" />Kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kowalamula wanhu woyowalonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:12">fana viya tata viyomlamula mwanage iyomulonda.<verse eid="PRO 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 3:13" />Watemeligwa mate wanhu wozahila ubala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:13">na wamweda wanhu wovimanya mbuli za chila siku.<verse eid="PRO 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 3:14" />Ubala wofaya kufosa hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:14">iviya wofaya kufosa zahabu yelile.<verse eid="PRO 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 3:15" />Ubala wofaya kufosa mabwe ya hela nyingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:15">na vinhu vose vouvilonda havifaya kufosa ubala.<verse eid="PRO 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 3:16" />Ubala wowatenda wanhu wakale siku nyingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:16">na kowatenda wanhu wapate vinhu vingi na wawe na hishima.<verse eid="PRO 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 3:17" />Nzila za ubala zinoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:17">na zogala tindiwalo.<verse eid="PRO 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 3:18" />Ubala ulinga fana mbiki wouweng'ha wanhu ugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:18">na wanhu hawaleka ubala wezadeng'helela.<verse eid="PRO 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 3:19" />Mndewa Mulungu keka vandusilo va isi kwa ubala wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:19">Mndewa Mulungu kagangamiza ulanga kwa umanyi wake.<verse eid="PRO 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 3:20" />Kwa kuvimanya kwake kayagola mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:20">na mawingu yalagaza mvula.<verse eid="PRO 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 3:21" />Mwanangu, ugendelele kutenda mbuli zigoloke na ukale kwa ubala.<verse eid="PRO 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 3:22" />Uhatenda ivo kwizakala vinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:22">na wanhu wezakuhishimu.<verse eid="PRO 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 3:23" />Baho kwizagenda goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:23">na hwizaikwala bule.<verse eid="PRO 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 3:24" />Vondautambalale, hwizadumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:24">Vondaugone, nhongo zako zizakuwa zinoga.<verse eid="PRO 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 3:25" />Hwizadumba mahulo vondayeze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:25">na hwizadumba kunangigwa hamwe na wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile.<verse eid="PRO 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 3:26" />Kwaviya kwizamuhuwila Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:26">yeye kezaukimila mgulu wako sekeunamate muna umtego.<verse eid="PRO 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 3:27" />One uhadaha kuweng'ha wanhu vinhu vinogile vowolondeka kupata, sekeuleke kutenda ivo.<verse eid="PRO 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 3:28" />Sekeumulongele mkaya miyago,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:28">“Bwela igolo nizakwing'ha,”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:28">kuno chinhu icho kunacho habehi.<verse eid="PRO 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 3:29" />Sekeuilunge kumtendela mbuli zihile mkaya miyago,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:29">yokala habehi na weye na yokuhuwila.<verse eid="PRO 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 3:30" />One munhu hakutendele mbuli yoyose ihile, sekeumulongeleze.<verse eid="PRO 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 3:31" />Sekeumuwonele migongo munhu msede,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:31">na sekeutogole kumuhiga.<verse eid="PRO 3:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 3:32" />Kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kowehila wanhu wavwizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:32">mbali wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wokuwa wambwiya zake.<verse eid="PRO 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 3:33" />Mndewa Mulungu koziduwila kaye za wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:33">mbali kozitemela mate kaye za wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile.<verse eid="PRO 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PRO 3:34" />Iviya kowehula wanhu wowehula wamwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:34">mbali kowawonela ubazi wanhu woinyendanyenda.<verse eid="PRO 3:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PRO 3:35" />Wabala wezahishimigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 3:35">mbali wabozi wezagumigwa chinyala.<verse eid="PRO 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PRO 4" />
  <para style="s">Tegeleza mafundizo ya tati yako</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 4:1" />Wanangu, tegelezeni niye tati yenu vonimfunzani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:1">kingeni digutwi mupate kuvimanya.<verse eid="PRO 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 4:2" />Kwaviya nomfunzani vinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:2">sekemuzimize mbuli zangu.<verse eid="PRO 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 4:3" />Vinikalile mbwanga mdodo muna ikaye ya tati yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:3">vinikalile ching'hele na mwana niidumwe kwa mami yangu,<verse eid="PRO 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 4:4" />tata kanifunza, kanilongela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:4">“Yamha mbuli zangu zose kwa moyo wako wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:4">zindilila ndagilizi zangu muladi uwe mgima.<verse eid="PRO 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 4:5" />Iyohe uifunze ubala na uwe na umanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:5">sekeuzimize mbuli zangu na sekeuzileke.<verse eid="PRO 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 4:6" />Uhazindilila mbuli zangu za ubala, zizakukaliza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:6">uzilonde, nazo zizakwamila.<verse eid="PRO 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 4:7" />Habule chinhu chikulu kufosa ubala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:7">kweli, lava vinhu vako vose upate umanyi.<verse eid="PRO 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 4:8" />Ugese mbuli za ubala na kwizahishimigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:8">uzamhe na kwizatogozigwa.<verse eid="PRO 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 4:9" />Wanhu vondawahulike mbuli zako za ubala wezakutogoza.”<verse eid="PRO 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 4:10" />Mwanangu, tegeleza na utogole mbuli zonikulongela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:10">muladi ukale miyaka mingi.<verse eid="PRO 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 4:11" />Nogendelela kukulongoza muna inzila ya ubala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:11">Nogendelela kukulongoza muna zinzila zigoloke.<verse eid="PRO 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 4:12" />Uhagenda, magulu yako hayezakimililigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:12">na uhakimbila, hwizaikwala.<verse eid="PRO 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 4:13" />Yamha mafundizo, sekeuyaleke yapulusuke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:13">uyazindilile muladi uwe mgima.<verse eid="PRO 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 4:14" />Sekeutende fana viwotenda wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:14">na sekeuwahige wanhu wehi.<verse eid="PRO 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 4:15" />Sekeutende fana viwotenda na uyepule nawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:15">uwafose na ugendelele.<verse eid="PRO 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 4:16" />Kwaviya wawo hawagona mbaka watende wihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:16">hawapata nhongo mbaka wambanange munhu.<verse eid="PRO 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 4:17" />Wolonda kutenda wihi fana viwolonda kuja ndiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:17">wolonda usede fana viwolonda ching'waji.<verse eid="PRO 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 4:18" />Mbali ugenzi wa wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile ulinga fana mhwani yau,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:18">yoibung'hula ng'hani mbaka imisi.<verse eid="PRO 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 4:19" />Ugenzi wa wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile ulinga fana ziza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:19">hawavimanyile chinhu chochiwatenda wagwe.<verse eid="PRO 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 4:20" />Mwanangu, tegeleza vinogile mbuli zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:20">kinga digutwi utegeleze chiya chinilonga.<verse eid="PRO 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 4:21" />Sekeuleke zisegele kumwako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:21">uzike goya muna umoyo wako.<verse eid="PRO 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 4:22" />Kwaviya mbuli izo ni ugima kwa waja wozipata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:22">na dawa kwa ng'huli zawo zose.<verse eid="PRO 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 4:23" />Kaliza moyo wako kufosa vinhu vose voukaliza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:23">kwaviya umo molawa ugima.<verse eid="PRO 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 4:24" />Sekeulonge mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:24">uyepule na mbuli hazifaya.<verse eid="PRO 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 4:25" />Meso yako yalole kuulongozi wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:25">lola kuulongozi wako dimwe kwa dimwe.<verse eid="PRO 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 4:26" />Kuluga hanhu houfosa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:26">nzila zako zose zigangamale.<verse eid="PRO 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 4:27" />Sekeubaguke ukulume hebu ukumoso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 4:27">uyepule mgulu wako kuna uwihi.<verse eid="PRO 4:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="PRO 5" />
  <para style="s">Wagoni wozumigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 5:1" />Mwanangu, tegeleza mbuli zangu za ubala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 5:1">kinga digutwi uhulike mbuli zangu za umanyi,<verse eid="PRO 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 5:2" />muladi udahe kusagula mbuli zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 5:2">na mbuli ziulonga zolagusa umanyi wako.<verse eid="PRO 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 5:3" />Kwaviya mulomo wa mwanamke malaya unoga fana uki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 5:3">na mbuli zake zotelebuka kufosa mavuta.<verse eid="PRO 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 5:4" />Mbali wausungu kufosa sungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 5:4">wokutwa fana panga dinoligwe kuno na kuno.<verse eid="PRO 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 5:5" />Migulu yake yohulumukila kuzimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 5:5">na kohita nzila ya kuna dileme.<verse eid="PRO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 5:6" />Kaizimiza nzila yoihita kuugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 5:6">mbali kogeza nzila zake zigoloka.<verse eid="PRO 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 5:7" />Ivo mwanangu, nitegeleze goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 5:7">sekeuleke mbuli zonikulongela.<verse eid="PRO 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 5:8" />Ukale nayo kutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 5:8">sekeulukwenhukile lwivi lwa kaye yake.<verse eid="PRO 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 5:9" />One hutendile ivo, hwizahishimigwa na wanhu wamwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 5:9">na hwizakomigwa na wasede.<verse eid="PRO 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 5:10" />Nyambenyambe wezapata utajili wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 5:10">vinhu vako vizakuwa muna ikaye ya munhu imwenga.<verse eid="PRO 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 5:11" />Kuuhelelo wa ugima wako kwizalila kwa usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 5:11">lusita lukuli lwako vondalulale.<verse eid="PRO 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 5:12" />Kwizalonga, “Silondile kuzumigwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 5:12">Moyo wangu ulema kukalikiligwa.<verse eid="PRO 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 5:13" />Siwategeleze wafundiza wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 5:13">na sitegeleze mafundizo yawo.<verse eid="PRO 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 5:14" />Lelo nogwa chinyala, hana umting'hano wa wanhu.”<verse eid="PRO 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 5:15" />Sekeudehe mazi muna ing'hupulilo ya munhu imwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 5:15">sigala na muke wako na umbandame yeye muhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 5:15">fana munhu viyong'wa mazi yolawa muna ing'hupulilo yake mwenyewo.<verse eid="PRO 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 5:16" />Kumbandama muke imwenga kulinga fana kwitila mazi yanogile muna dikulugumbi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 5:16">sekeutende ivo.<verse eid="PRO 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 5:17" />Umbandame muke wako muhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 5:17">sekeuwabandame wake wamwenga.<verse eid="PRO 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 5:18" />Umdeng'helele muke iumsolile ung'hali mbwanga.<verse eid="PRO 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 5:19" />Yeye kanoga na kogenda vinogile fana mhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 5:19">ulondo wake ukudeng'heleze siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 5:19">unogelwe na ulondo wake siku zose.<verse eid="PRO 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 5:20" />Mwanangu, habali unogelwe na mwanamke malaya?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 5:20">Habali umbandame muke imwenga?<verse eid="PRO 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 5:21" />Mndewa Mulungu kolola chila chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 5:21">kolola chila chinhu chiyotenda munhu.<verse eid="PRO 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 5:22" />Sang'hano zihile za wanhu wehi zowanamata wenyewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 5:22">uhasanyi wawo ulinga fana nzabi zoziwatataliza.<verse eid="PRO 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 5:23" />Wezadanganika kwaviya hawadaha kuzikimilila tamaa zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 5:23">wavwiziligwa kwa ubozi wawo wenyewo.<verse eid="PRO 5:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="PRO 6" />
  <para style="s">Mazumo kusonhela ubozi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 6:1" />Mwanangu, one kuilaha kumulihila mkaya miyago hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:1">one kwika chilagano kwa ichimu cha munhu imwenga,<verse eid="PRO 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 6:2" />one kuifunga kwa mbuli zako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:2">na kuinamata na chilagano chako,<verse eid="PRO 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 6:3" />lelo mwanangu, tenda vino uilegehe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:3">kwaviya kuiguma muna yamakono ya mkaya miyago,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:3">hita ukainyendenyende kumwake na kumulamba mkaya miyago!<verse eid="PRO 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 6:4" />Meso yako sekeyakukile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:4">na ngohe zako sekezifinye.<verse eid="PRO 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 6:5" />Usulupuke fana mhala viyosulupuka muna yamakono ya munhu yeli kuukala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:5">fana ndege muna umkono wa munhu yotega mtego.<verse eid="PRO 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 6:6" />Weye munhu mbwa, ifunze kwa muswa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:6">zilolese nzila zake upate umanyi.<verse eid="PRO 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 6:7" />Yeye kabule mulangulizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:7">hebu mwimilizi hebu munhu mkulu,<verse eid="PRO 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 6:8" />mbali koikila ngama lusita lwa zuwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:8">koduganya ndiya yake chipindi cha kugobola.<verse eid="PRO 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 6:9" />Vino weye munhu mbwa, kwizagona mbaka zuwaki?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:9">Vino kwizalamka zuwaki muna zinhongo zako?<verse eid="PRO 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 6:10" />Gona chidogo, kukila chidogo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:10">ibetebete makono yako uhumule chidogo.<verse eid="PRO 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 6:11" />Ivo ungayengaye wako wokwiza fana munhu mbavi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:11">na kulonda kwako kokwizila kwa kusinhukila fana munhu viyokwingila kubawa muna ikaye.<verse eid="PRO 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 6:12" />Munhu hafaya chinhu, munhu yehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:12">kogenda muna inzila kuno kolonga mbuli za kwagiza.<verse eid="PRO 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 6:13" />Kofunyiza kwa meso yake, kolonga kwa migulu yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:13">kowalagusa wanhu kwa vidole vake,<verse eid="PRO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 6:14" />kuno koilunga kutenda mbuli zihile na koilunga kuvwiza muna umoyo wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:14">kokong'hela ndwagi siku zose.<verse eid="PRO 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 6:15" />Munhu fana iyo kezapata ndilo kwa kusinhukiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:15">kezanangigwa na habule munhu wa kumtaza.<verse eid="PRO 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 6:16" />Kuna vinhu sita havilonda Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:16">vauko vinhu saba vili viyovihila,<verse eid="PRO 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 6:17" />meso ya magoda na lulimi lulonga uvwizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:17">na makono yokoma munhu yelibule ubananzi<verse eid="PRO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 6:18" />na moyo wougesa malungilo yehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:18">na migulu ihuhile kukimbilila wihi,<verse eid="PRO 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 6:19" />na msindila wa uvwizi yolonga mbuli za uvwizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:19">na munhu yokong'hela mbuli za udelenya kwa wanhu.<verse eid="PRO 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wagoni wozumigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 6:20" />Mwanangu, yamha ndagilizi za tati yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:20">sekeuleke mafundizo ya mami yako.<verse eid="PRO 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wagoni</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 6:21" />Sekeuzimize mbuli zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:21">na uzifunge muna isingo yako.<verse eid="PRO 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 6:22" />Hondauhite zizakulongoza, hondaugone zizakukaliza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:22">uhalamka muna zinhongo zizalonga na weye.<verse eid="PRO 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 6:23" />Kwaviya ndagilizi zino ni chitasa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:23">mafundizo yano ni bung'hulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:23">na kumzuma munhu ni nzila ya ugima.<verse eid="PRO 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 6:24" />Zikukalize na muke mwihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:24">muladi uyepule na mbuli za kuhembeleza za mwanamke malaya.<verse eid="PRO 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 6:25" />Moyo wako sekeumelele mate unovu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:25">na meso yake sekeyakunamate.<verse eid="PRO 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 6:26" />Kwaviya mwanamke malaya kezakutenda uwe ngayengaye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:26">muke wa munhu imwenga kousepa ugima wako.<verse eid="PRO 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 6:27" />Vino munhu kodaha kwika kala da moto muna diwambo da munhu imwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:27">na walo jake sekedilungule?<verse eid="PRO 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 6:28" />Vino munhu kodaha kubojoga makala ya moto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:28">na migulu yake sekeilungule?<verse eid="PRO 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 6:29" />Niivo viyeli munhu yombandama muke wa munhu imwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:29">chila munhu yomdalisa muke iyo kezatagusigwa.<verse eid="PRO 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 6:30" />Munhu mbavi yahabawa kwa ichimu cha nzala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:30">wanhu hawamwehula.<verse eid="PRO 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 6:31" />One yahagwiligwa, kolondeka yalihe miyanza saba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:31">na kezalava chila chinhu chili muna ikaye yake.<verse eid="PRO 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 6:32" />Mbali mulume yombandama muke yeli siyo wake, iyo mbozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:32">yoyose yotenda ivo, koidanganiza mwenyewo.<verse eid="PRO 6:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 6:33" />Kezatowigwa na kezapata chinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:33">na chinyala chake chizakuwa cha siku zose.<verse eid="PRO 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PRO 6:34" />Kwaviya wivu wolamsa ludoko lwa mulume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:34">nayo hezakuwa na ubazi siku ya kulihiliza.<verse eid="PRO 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PRO 6:35" />Hezatogola kulihigwa nguku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 6:35">na kezayalema maliho, hata yahawa makulu ng'hani.<verse eid="PRO 6:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="PRO 7" />
  <para style="s">Uiteganye na mwanamke malaya</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 7:1" />Mwanangu, tegeleza mbuli zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:1">na uzindilile ndagilizi zangu.<verse eid="PRO 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 7:2" />Zindilila ndagilizi zangu muladi uwe mgima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:2">kaliza mafundizo yangu fana mwana ziso jako.<verse eid="PRO 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 7:3" />Zifunge muna umkono wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:3">na zandike muna umoyo wako.<verse eid="PRO 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 7:4" />Ulonde mbuli za ubala fana viumulonda mwali wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:4">ulonde umanyi fana viumulonda ndugu yako.<verse eid="PRO 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 7:5" />Zizakukaliza na mwanamke mgoni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:5">zizakukaliza na mwanamke malaya yokuhembeleza kwa mbuli zake zinogile.<verse eid="PRO 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 7:6" />Siku dimwe vinikalile muna ikaye yangu, nima hana dizonzo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:6">nisungulila kunze.<verse eid="PRO 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 7:7" />Niwawona wabwanga wengi hawavimanyile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:7">mbwanga imwe kakala mbozi ng'hani.<verse eid="PRO 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 7:8" />Kakala yofosa habehi na chingolobweda cha kaye ya mwanamke malaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:8">kohita kuna ikaye yake.<verse eid="PRO 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 7:9" />Ikala imingilo, zuwa doswa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:9">ichilo chikulu.<verse eid="PRO 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 7:10" />Baho mwanamke iyo kalawa kumuhokela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:10">kuno kaiyawala fana malaya na kailungila uvwizi.<verse eid="PRO 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 7:11" />Kana gubu na mtatali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:11">hahumula hakaye yake.<verse eid="PRO 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 7:12" />Lusita lumwenga kokuwa kuna dikulugumbi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:12">lusita lumwenga kokuwa kuna ulubuga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:12">kozebwegela chila ubanzi kosepa mulume.<verse eid="PRO 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 7:13" />Komuhagata mbwanga iyo na komnonela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:13">iviya komulongela bila ya chinyala,<verse eid="PRO 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 7:14" />“Ninazo nyama za nhambiko yonilavile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:14">diyelo nifikiza vilaho vangu.<verse eid="PRO 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 7:15" />Nikuzahila na nikuwona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:15">ivo niza kuiting'hana na weye.<verse eid="PRO 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 7:16" />Nitandika goya komwa jangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:16">kwa migolole ya chitani ilawile Misili ili na langi zinogile.<verse eid="PRO 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 7:17" />Komwa jangu nidimizila mavuta yonung'hila goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:17">manemane na udi na mdalasini.<verse eid="PRO 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 7:18" />Izo chikagone mbaka imitondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:18">chideng'helele ulondo muna imizoyo yetu.<verse eid="PRO 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 7:19" />Kwaviya mulumangu kahabule hakaye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:19">kahita mwanza wa kutali.<verse eid="PRO 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 7:20" />Kasola mfuko wake wa hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:20">na kezabwela mwezi uhakangala.”<verse eid="PRO 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 7:21" />Kamulongela mbuli za kumdeng'heleza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:21">kamuhembeleza kwa mbuli zake zinogile.<verse eid="PRO 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 7:22" />Baho kamsondelela muke iyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:22">fana viya ng'ombe viyohita kuchinjigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:22">hebu mbozi viyofungigwa mhingu,<verse eid="PRO 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 7:23" />mbaka msale umuhome ini jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:23">fana ndege viyohita kuna umtego,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:23">bila kuvimanya kuwa kezakufa.<verse eid="PRO 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 7:24" />Lelo wabwanga zangu, kingeni digutwi mnhegeleze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:24">muzamhe mbuli zonilonga.<verse eid="PRO 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 7:25" />Mizoyo yenu sekeisondelele nzila za mwanamke iyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:25">na sekemuuwegele hanhu hoyafosile.<verse eid="PRO 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 7:26" />Kwaviya kawabananga wengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:26">na kawachinja wengi.<verse eid="PRO 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 7:27" />Kaye ya muke iyo ni kulugumbi dodisonhela kuzimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 7:27">yohulumukila kuna iifa.<verse eid="PRO 7:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="PRO 8" />
  <para style="s">Mbuli za ubala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 8:1" />Tegelezeni mbuli za ubala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:1">umanyi ulinga fana mwanamke yowatanga wanhu wamtegeleze.<verse eid="PRO 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 8:2" />Mwanamke iyo kokwima uchanyha ya milima habehi na nzila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:2">kokwima hana inzila mhanda.<verse eid="PRO 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 8:3" />Kokwima habehi na nyivi za kwingilila muna dibululu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:3">kotanga kwa dizi kulu,<verse eid="PRO 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 8:4" />“Mweye walume, nomtangani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:4">nowalandulila dizi jangu wanhu wose.<verse eid="PRO 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 8:5" />Mweye wabozi, ifunzeni kuwa na nzewele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:5">kingeni digutwi, mweye hamvimanyile.<verse eid="PRO 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 8:6" />Tegelezeni kwaviya nina mbuli ng'hulu za kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:6">nonamula mulomo wangu na nomulongelani mbuli zigoloke.<verse eid="PRO 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 8:7" />Nizalonga ukweli muhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:7">nowihila wihi.<verse eid="PRO 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 8:8" />Mbuli zose zonilonga zigoloka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:8">habule mbuli ihile hebu ya uvwizi.<verse eid="PRO 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 8:9" />Kwa wanhu wovimanya, mbuli zangu zomanyika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:9">kwa wanhu weli na nzewele, mbuli zangu zigoloka.<verse eid="PRO 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 8:10" />Sagula mafundizo yangu badala ya hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:10">sagula umanyi badala ya zahabu inogile.<verse eid="PRO 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 8:11" />Kwaviya kuwa na ubala kunoga kufosa mabwe ya hela nyingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:11">na chochose chouchilonda hachiilinga na ubala.”<verse eid="PRO 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 8:12" />Ubala ulinga fana munhu yolonga, “Niye nokala hamwe na nzewele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:12">novimanya na nosagula vinogile.<verse eid="PRO 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 8:13" />Kumdumba Mndewa Mulungu ni kuwihila wihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:13">niye nokwihila utatali na magoda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:13">nokwihila mbuli za chinyala.<verse eid="PRO 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 8:14" />Nodaha kulava magesa yanogile kwa munhu na kulamula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:14">novimanya na nina nguvu.<verse eid="PRO 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 8:15" />Nowataza wafalume kutawala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:15">na walangulizi kulagiliza voilondeka.<verse eid="PRO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 8:16" />Nowataza walangulizi kulanguliza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:16">nowataza watawala na wasemi wose.<verse eid="PRO 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 8:17" />Nowalonda waja wonilonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:17">waja wonizahila niye wezaniwona.<verse eid="PRO 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 8:18" />Nina utajili na hishima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:18">nina utajili wa siku zose na unovu.<verse eid="PRO 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 8:19" />Tunda jangu dinoga kufosa zahabu inogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:19">chinhu chonilava chinoga kufosa hela inogile.<verse eid="PRO 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 8:20" />Nogendelela kutenda mbuli zinogile na zigoloke,<verse eid="PRO 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 8:21" />na noweng'ha utajili waja wonilonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:21">nizamemeza ngama zawo.<verse eid="PRO 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 8:22" />Mndewa Mulungu kanilumba mwanduso wa sang'hano zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:22">kanilumba yang'hali hanakwandusa sang'hano zake za umwaka.<verse eid="PRO 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 8:23" />Nisaguligwa kwandusila umwaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:23">nisaguligwa isi ing'hali hainalumbigwa.<verse eid="PRO 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 8:24" />Nivumbuligwa ing'hali vilindi va mazi havinakuwa uko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:24">kukala kwabule nzasa za mazi.<verse eid="PRO 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 8:25" />Nivumbuka ing'hali milima hainagangamizigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:25">nivumbuka ing'hali vilima havinakuwa uko.<verse eid="PRO 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 8:26" />Nivumbuka Mulungu yang'hali hanalumba isi na migunda na timbwisi da isi.<verse eid="PRO 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 8:27" />Nikala uko lusita ulanga viulumbigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:27">viyagolile ulanga na bahali.<verse eid="PRO 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 8:28" />Nikala uko viyalumbile mawingu yeli uchanyha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:28">viyatobole nzasa za mazi.<verse eid="PRO 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 8:29" />Nikala uko viyekile mhaka ya bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:29">muladi mazi yake yazindilile lagilizo jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:29">nikala uko viyalumbile vandusilo va isi.<verse eid="PRO 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 8:30" />Nikala hamwe nayo fana mwana mdodo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:30">nimemezigwa deng'ho chila siku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:30">siku zose nideng'helela haulongozi wake.<verse eid="PRO 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 8:31" />Nideng'helela isi iwokala wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:31">niwadeng'helela wanhu.<verse eid="PRO 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 8:32" />Lelo wanangu nitegelezeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:32">watemeligwa mate wanhu waja wosondelela mbuli zangu.<verse eid="PRO 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 8:33" />Tegelezeni mafundizo yangu muladi muwe na ubala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:33">na sekemuyaleme mafundizo yayo.<verse eid="PRO 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PRO 8:34" />Watemeligwa mate waja wonitegeleza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:34">wogozela siku zose muna zinyivi zangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:34">wogozela hana ivizingiti vangu.<verse eid="PRO 8:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PRO 8:35" />Kwaviya wanhu woniwona niye wowona ugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:35">nawo wezatogoligwa na Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="PRO 8:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PRO 8:36" />Mbali wanhu wonipuwa niye woinanga wenyewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 8:36">na wose wonihila niye wolonda ifa.”<verse eid="PRO 8:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="PRO 9" />
  <para style="s">Ubala na ubozi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 9:1" />Ubala ulinga fana muke yazengile kaye yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 9:1">na kasongola mhanda zake saba.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Saba fambulo jake chinhu chigangamale.</char></note><verse eid="PRO 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 9:2" />Kasasala nyama yake na kahanganya vilungo na divai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 9:2">na kasasala meza yake.<verse eid="PRO 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 9:3" />Kowatuma wasang'hani wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 9:3">muladi wawatange wanhu kulawa uchanyha ya bululu.<verse eid="PRO 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 9:4" />Kowalongela wabozi wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 9:4">“Munhu havimanyile yengile muna ikaye yangu.<verse eid="PRO 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 9:5" />Izo uje ndiya yangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 9:5">na ung'we divai iniihanganye.<verse eid="PRO 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 9:6" />Leka magesa yako ya ubozi, muladi udahe kuwa mgima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 9:6">ifunze muladi upate nzewele.”<verse eid="PRO 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 9:7" />Yoyose yomzuma munhu yotenda ugongo, kohokela maligo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 9:7">yomkalikila munhu mwihi kezalumizigwa.<verse eid="PRO 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 9:8" />Sekeumkalikile munhu yeli na magoda kwaviya kezakwihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 9:8">one uhamkalikila munhu mbala, kezakulonda.<verse eid="PRO 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 9:9" />Mfunze munhu mbala, nayo kezaiyoha kuvimanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 9:9">mfunze munhu yotenda mbuli zinogile, nayo kezaiyoha kuifunza.<verse eid="PRO 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 9:10" />Uhalonda kuwa mbala wanduse kumdumba Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 9:10">na kummanya Mulungu Yelile ni mwanduso wa umanyi.<verse eid="PRO 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 9:11" />Kwaviya uhawa mbala, siku zako zizakongezeka</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 9:11">na kwizakongezeligwa miyaka ya kuwa mgima.<verse eid="PRO 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 9:12" />One uhawa mbala, kwizagwekigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 9:12">one uhalema ubala, kwizagaya.<verse eid="PRO 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 9:13" />Mwanamke mbozi kana gubu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 9:13">yeye mbunye na hamanya mbuli yoyose.<verse eid="PRO 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 9:14" />Kokala hana ulwivi lwa kaye yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 9:14">kokala muna ichigoda uchanyha ya bululu,<verse eid="PRO 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 9:15" />muladi yawatange wanhu wofosa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 9:15">wogenda muna inzila yawo.<verse eid="PRO 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 9:16" />Wanhu hawavimanyile kowalongela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 9:16">“Wabozi wose wengile muno!<verse eid="PRO 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 9:17" />Mazi yabawigwe yamulile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 9:17">gate didigwe kwa kwiifisa dinoga ng'hani.”<verse eid="PRO 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 9:18" />Mbali mambunye wawo hawavimanyile kuwa wanhu wadanganike waumo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 9:18">kuwa wanhu woyawahokele mwanamke iyo wamuna ivilindi va kuzimu.<verse eid="PRO 9:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="PRO 10" />
  <para style="s">Masimwe ya Sulemani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 10:1" />Masimwe ya Sulemani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:1">mwana mbala komtenda tati yake yadeng'helele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:1">mbali mwana mbozi komtenda mami yake yawone usungu.<verse eid="PRO 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 10:2" />Vinhu voupata kwa kutenda wihi havifaya chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:2">mbali kutenda mbuli zinogile komulopola munhu kulawa muna iifa.<verse eid="PRO 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 10:3" />Mndewa Mulungu hawaleka wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wakale na nzala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:3">mbali kolema wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile sekewegute.<verse eid="PRO 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 10:4" />Wanhu wabwa wokuwa ngayengaye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:4">mbali wanhu wosang'hana sang'hano kwa kuiyoha wokuwa na vinhu vingi.<verse eid="PRO 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 10:5" />Munhu yoduganya lusita lwa kugobola mbala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:5">mbali munhu yogona chipindi cha kugobola koguma chinyala.<verse eid="PRO 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 10:6" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wotemeligwa mate,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:6">mbali wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile, viwolonga wofisa malungilo yawo ya usede.<verse eid="PRO 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 10:7" />Mazina ya wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile, yezasang'haniligwa kutemela mate,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:7">mbali mazina ya wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile yezakwaga.<verse eid="PRO 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 10:8" />Wabala wotogola malagilizo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:8">mbali wabozi watatali wohanja, wezanangigwa.<verse eid="PRO 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 10:9" />Wanhu wotenda chiwolonga wokala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:9">mbali wanhu wadelenya wezamanyika.<verse eid="PRO 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 10:10" />Wanhu wofunyiza kwa uvwizi wogala magayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:10">na wabozi watatali wohanja, woinanga wenyewo.<verse eid="PRO 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 10:11" />Milomo ya wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile ilinga fana nzasa za mazi zozigala ugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:11">mbali wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile viwolonga wofisa malungilo yawo ya usede.<verse eid="PRO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 10:12" />Kwiihila kogala ndwagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:12">mbali ulondo wolekelela uhasanyi wose.<verse eid="PRO 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 10:13" />Mbuli za ubala zopatika muna imilomo ya wanhu wovimanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:13">mbali wabozi wezatagusigwa kwa kulanhigwa mibalati mumgongo.<verse eid="PRO 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 10:14" />Wanhu wabala wokongeza umanyi fana ngama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:14">mbali wabozi watatali wohanja, wogala kunangigwa.<verse eid="PRO 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 10:15" />Utajili wa munhu yeli na vinhu vingi ulinga fana bululu dili na mhongono,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:15">uchiwa wa ngayengaye womtenda yanangigwe.<verse eid="PRO 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 10:16" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wolihigwa ugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:16">mbali wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wolihigwa nhaguso.<verse eid="PRO 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 10:17" />Wanhu wotogola kuzumigwa wezakuwa wagima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:17">mbali wanhu wokwehula kulamuligwa wokwaga.<verse eid="PRO 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 10:18" />Wanhu wowehila wayawo kwa mvisa ni wadelenya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:18">wanhu wowalongeleza uvwizi wayawo ni wabozi.<verse eid="PRO 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 10:19" />Kulonga ng'hani kowatenda wanhu wahasanye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:19">mbali wanhu wokimilila ndimi zawo wotenda goya.<verse eid="PRO 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 10:20" />Ndimi za wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile zilinga fana hela inogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:20">mbali mizoyo ya wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile, haifaya chinhu.<verse eid="PRO 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 10:21" />Mafundizo ya wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile yowataza wanhu wamwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:21">mbali wabozi watatali wodanganika kwaviya hawavimanyile.<verse eid="PRO 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 10:22" />Kutemela mate kwa Mndewa Mulungu kogala utajili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:22">na hakuhanganyigwa na usungu.<verse eid="PRO 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 10:23" />Wabozi wodeng'helela kutenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:23">mbali wanhu weli na nzewele wolonda ubala.<verse eid="PRO 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 10:24" />Vinhu vowodumba wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile, niivo vondawapate,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:24">viwolonda wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wezakwing'higwa.<verse eid="PRO 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 10:25" />Vulavumbi dihafosa, wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wezasegezigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:25">mbali wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wezakwima chigangamavu siku zose.<verse eid="PRO 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 10:26" />Fana siki muna umulomo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:26">fana yosi muna yameso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:26">niivo viyeli munhu mbwa kwa waja wamtumile kusang'hana.<verse eid="PRO 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 10:27" />Kumdumba Mndewa Mulungu kokongeza siku za kuwa mgima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:27">mbali miyaka ya wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile izahunguzigwa.<verse eid="PRO 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 10:28" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wohuwila deng'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:28">mbali chinhu chowololela wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile hachilawilila.<verse eid="PRO 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 10:29" />Mndewa Mulungu kowakaliza wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:29">mbali kowananga wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile.<verse eid="PRO 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 10:30" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile hawezasegezigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:30">mbali wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile hawezasigala muna iisi.<verse eid="PRO 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 10:31" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wolonga kwa ubala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:31">mbali Mulungu kezawafudaza wanhu wolonga uvwizi.<verse eid="PRO 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 10:32" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wovimanya mbuli ifaya kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 10:32">mbali wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wolonga mbuli za uvwizi.<verse eid="PRO 10:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="PRO 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 11:1" />Mndewa Mulungu kozihila ningo za kubamanya wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:1">mbali konogelwa na ningo zigoloke.<verse eid="PRO 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 11:2" />Magoda yaheza, chinyala nacho chokwiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:2">mbali unyendanyenda wokwiza na ubala.<verse eid="PRO 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 11:3" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wolangulizigwa na ukweli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:3">mbali wanhu hawaminika wonangigwa kwa udelenya wawo.<verse eid="PRO 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 11:4" />Utajili haufaya chinhu muna isiku ya nhaguso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:4">mbali kutenda mbuli zinogile kowakombola wanhu muna iifa.<verse eid="PRO 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 11:5" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wosondelela nzila zigoloke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:5">mbali wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wezanangigwa kwa wihi wawo.<verse eid="PRO 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 11:6" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wezakomboligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:6">mbali wanhu weli siyo waminika wonamatigwa na malungilo yawo yehile.<verse eid="PRO 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 11:7" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wahadanganika, huwilo jawo dokwaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:7">kwaviya woihuwila wenyewo.<verse eid="PRO 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 11:8" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile, wokomboligwa kulawa muna uuzidilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:8">wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wokwingila umo.<verse eid="PRO 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 11:9" />Viwolonga, wanhu hawamuhuwila Mulungu wowananga wakaya wayawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:9">mbali kwa umanyi wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wokomboligwa.<verse eid="PRO 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 11:10" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wahatemeligwa mate, wanhu wamwenga wodeng'helela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:10">na wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wahadanganika, wanhu wa wamwenga wosekelela.<verse eid="PRO 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 11:11" />Bululu dokuwa kulu one wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wahaditemela mate,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:11">mbali bululu donangigwa kwa milomo ya wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile.<verse eid="PRO 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 11:12" />Wanhu welibule nzewele wowazeha wakaya wayawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:12">mbali wanhu weli na umanyi wonyamala.<verse eid="PRO 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 11:13" />Wanhu wadesi wolonga sili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:13">mbali wanhu waminika woika muumoyo.<verse eid="PRO 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 11:14" />Isi ilibule walangulizi wabala izakugwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:14">mbali isi ili na wakulu wengi izagangamala.<verse eid="PRO 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 11:15" />Wanhu woilava kuwalihila nyambenyambe madeni yawo, kweli wezagaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:15">mbali wanhu wolema kuilava kuwalihila wanhu wamwenga madeni yawo, wezakala goya.<verse eid="PRO 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 11:16" />Wake weli na ubazi wohishimika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:16">mbali watatali weli na nguvu wopata utajili.<verse eid="PRO 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 11:17" />Wanhu wowawonela ubazi wamwenga, wezagwekigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:17">mbali wanhu wasede woigalila magayo wenyewo.<verse eid="PRO 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 11:18" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wezapata gweko da uvwizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:18">mbali wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wopata gweko da kweli.<verse eid="PRO 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 11:19" />Kweli wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wopata ugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:19">mbali wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wolonda ifa.<verse eid="PRO 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 11:20" />Mndewa Mulungu kowehila ng'hani wanhu wogesa mbuli za kutibusa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:20">mbali konogelwa na wanhu welibule ubananzi.<verse eid="PRO 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 11:21" />Kweli wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile hawaswela kutagusigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:21">mbali wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wezailegeha.<verse eid="PRO 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 11:22" />Fana vitindi va zahabu muna imhula ya nguluwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:22">niivo viyeli mwanamke yanogile havimanyile kusagula vinogile.<verse eid="PRO 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 11:23" />Vinhu vowolonda wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile, vogala unovu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:23">mbali vinhu vowolonda wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile vomguma ludoko Mulungu.<verse eid="PRO 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 11:24" />Wanhu wolava kwa makono maidi wokongezeligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:24">mbali wanhu wagila wokuwa ngayengaye.<verse eid="PRO 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 11:25" />Wanhu wolava vinhu kwa makono maidi wezatemeligwa mate,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:25">wanhu wowang'wiza mazi wamwenga wezakung'wizigwa.<verse eid="PRO 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 11:26" />Wanhu womduwila munhu yowema wanhu ndiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:26">mbali wanhu womtemela mate munhu yotogola kuchuuza ndiya.<verse eid="PRO 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 11:27" />Wanhu wozahila mbuli zinogile wolondigwa na wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:27">mbali wanhu wozahila mbuli zihile wezazipata.<verse eid="PRO 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 11:28" />Wanhu wohuwila utajili wawo wezakugwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:28">mbali wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wezatelela fana yani bisi.<verse eid="PRO 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 11:29" />Wanhu wogala magayo muna zikaye zawo hawezahazi chochose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:29">na wabozi watatali wezakuwa wasang'hani wa wanhu wabala.<verse eid="PRO 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 11:30" />Tunda da wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile ni ugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:30">na wanhu wabala wowakwega wanhu.<verse eid="PRO 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 11:31" />One wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wahahokela gweko jawo muna iisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 11:31">iviya wanhu hawamdumba Mulungu na wahasanyi wezahokela gweko jawo da nhaguso.<verse eid="PRO 11:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="PRO 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 12:1" />Wanhu wolonda kulamuligwa iviya wolonda umanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:1">mbali wanhu wabozi hawalonda kuzumigwa.<verse eid="PRO 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 12:2" />Mndewa Mulungu kowatogola wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:2">mbali kowatagusa wanhu waselesi.<verse eid="PRO 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 12:3" />Wanhu hawadaha kugangamizigwa kwa kutenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:3">mbali wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wezagangamala.<verse eid="PRO 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 12:4" />Muke yeli na ugenzi unogile ni kombelo da mulumake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:4">mbali muke yoguma chinyala kalinga fana chinhu chiwolile muna yamavuha ya mulumake.<verse eid="PRO 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 12:5" />Malungilo ya wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile yagoloka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:5">mbali magesa ya wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile ni uvwizi.<verse eid="PRO 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 12:6" />Mbuli ziwolonga wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile zoilungila kukoma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:6">mbali mbuli ziwolonga waminika zowakombola.<verse eid="PRO 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 12:7" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wezadanganika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:7">mbali kaye za wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile zizagangamala.<verse eid="PRO 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 12:8" />Wanhu weli na nzewele wotogoligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:8">mbali wabozi watatali wokwehuligwa.<verse eid="PRO 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 12:9" />Muhavu munhu yozehigwa kuno kana msang'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:9">kufosa kuitenda munhu mkulu mbali kwabule ndiya.<verse eid="PRO 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 12:10" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wolola goya wanyama wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:10">mbali wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wasede ng'hani.<verse eid="PRO 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 12:11" />Wanhu wolima migunda yawo wezakuwa na ndiya nyingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:11">mbali wanhu wotenda mbuli za chakachaka wabule nzewele.<verse eid="PRO 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 12:12" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile womelela mate vinhu viwahokile wanhu wehi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:12">mbali sina da wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile dokwima matunda.<verse eid="PRO 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 12:13" />Wabananzi wonamatigwa na mbuli zawo zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:13">mbali wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile woyepula na magayo.<verse eid="PRO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 12:14" />Wanhu wezakwiguta mbuli zinogile kwa matunda ya milomo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:14">na wezabwelezeligwa sang'hano za makono yawo.<verse eid="PRO 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 12:15" />Nzila ya wabozi watatali iwanogela wawo wenyewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:15">mbali wanhu wabala wotegeleza magesa yanogile.<verse eid="PRO 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 12:16" />Wanhu wabozi watatali wolagusa ludoko lwawo bahobaho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:16">mbali wanhu wovimanya wowehula wanhu wowazeha.<verse eid="PRO 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 12:17" />Wanhu waminika wolava ukalangama wa ukweli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:17">mbali wasindila wa uvwizi wolonga uvwizi.<verse eid="PRO 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 12:18" />Mbuli ziwolonga wanhu bila kugesa zohoma fana zele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:18">mbali mbuli ziwolonga wanhu wabala zohonya.<verse eid="PRO 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 12:19" />Mulomo ulonga ukweli wofunya umoyo siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:19">mbali lulimi lwa uvwizi lokala chidogo.<verse eid="PRO 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 12:20" />Uvwizi wamuna imizoyo ya waja wogesa wihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:20">mbali waja wogala tindiwalo wana deng'ho kulu.<verse eid="PRO 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 12:21" />Habule mbuli ihile yondaiwapate wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:21">mbali wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wezamemezigwa magayo.<verse eid="PRO 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 12:22" />Mndewa Mulungu kowehila wanhu wolonga uvwizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:22">mbali kowadeng'helela wanhu wolonga kweli.<verse eid="PRO 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 12:23" />Wanhu wabala wofisa umanyi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:23">mbali mizoyo ya wanhu wabozi yogong'onda ubozi.<verse eid="PRO 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 12:24" />Makono ya wanhu woiyoha yezatawala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:24">mbali wanhu wabwa wezakuwa watumwa.<verse eid="PRO 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 12:25" />Moyo kusinha wowatenda wanhu wawe na mnamilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:25">mbali mbuli za kuguma moyo zowasangalaza wanhu.<verse eid="PRO 12:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 12:26" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wosagula wambwiya wanogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:26">mbali wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile woyagiza wenyewo.<verse eid="PRO 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 12:27" />Wanhu wabwa hawabanika nyama ziwapatile kuukala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 12:27">mbali wanhu woiyoha wezapata vinhu va hela nyingi.<verse eid="PRO 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 12:28" />Muna inzila inogile kuna ugima mbali siyo ifa.<verse eid="PRO 12:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="PRO 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 13:1" />Wana wabala wohulika chiya chiwolongiligwa na tati zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 13:1">mbali wakewezi hawahulika viwozumigwa.<verse eid="PRO 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 13:2" />Wanhu wezapata mbuli zinogile kwa matunda ya milomo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 13:2">mbali wavwizi wolonda usede.<verse eid="PRO 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 13:3" />Wanhu woteganya kulonga wokaliza ugima wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 13:3">mbali wanhu wohanja wezanangigwa.<verse eid="PRO 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 13:4" />Wanhu wabwa womelela mate ng'hani na hawapata chochose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 13:4">mbali wanhu woiyoha wezapata vinhu vingi.<verse eid="PRO 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 13:5" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wokwihila kulonga uvwizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 13:5">mbali wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile woguma chinyala na wokwehuligwa.<verse eid="PRO 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 13:6" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wezakalizigwa vinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 13:6">mbali wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wezanangigwa.<verse eid="PRO 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 13:7" />Munhu imwe koitenda tajili, mbali kabule chinhu chochose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 13:7">munhu imwenga koitenda ngayengaye, mbali kana vinhu vingi.<verse eid="PRO 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 13:8" />Utajili wa munhu wolondeka kukombola ugima wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 13:8">mbali munhu ngayengaye kabule chinhu cha kumdumbiza.<verse eid="PRO 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 13:9" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile womwemwesa fana bung'hulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 13:9">mbali wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wozimigwa fana vitasa.<verse eid="PRO 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 13:10" />Magoda yogala ndwagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 13:10">mbali wanhu wotegeleza magesa yanogile wana ubala.<verse eid="PRO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 13:11" />Hela ipatike kwa ubamanyi izakwaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 13:11">mbali wanhu woduganya chidogo chidogo wezakongezeligwa.<verse eid="PRO 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 13:12" />One wanhu hawapatile chinhu chowohuwila kupata, wokuwa na usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 13:12">mbali wahapata chinhu chowohuwila wodeng'helela.<verse eid="PRO 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 13:13" />Wanhu wokwehula mafundizo woinanga wenyewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 13:13">mbali wanhu wozindilila malagilizo wezagwekigwa.<verse eid="PRO 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 13:14" />Mafundizo yanogile ni chandusilo cha ugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 13:14">yowataza wanhu kuyepula na mitego ya ifa.<verse eid="PRO 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 13:15" />Wanhu wowodaha kusagula vinogile wohishimigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 13:15">mbali wanhu haweli waminika wezanangigwa.<verse eid="PRO 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 13:16" />Wanhu wabala wosang'hana kwa umanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 13:16">mbali wabozi wolagusa ubozi wawo.<verse eid="PRO 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 13:17" />Msenga heli mwaminika kokwingila muna yamagayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 13:17">mbali msenga mwaminika kogala uhonyi.<verse eid="PRO 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 13:18" />Wanhu hawalonda kuzumigwa wopata ungayengaye na chinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 13:18">mbali wanhu wotogola kuzumigwa wohishimigwa.<verse eid="PRO 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 13:19" />Wanhu wahapata chinhu chowahuwile wodeng'helela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 13:19">mbali wabozi wokwihila kuleka kutenda mbuli zihile.<verse eid="PRO 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 13:20" />Wanhu wogenda na wabala wezakuwa wabala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 13:20">mbali wambwiya wa wabozi wezagaya.<verse eid="PRO 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 13:21" />Magayo yowawingisa wahasanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 13:21">mbali wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wezapata vinhu vinogile.<verse eid="PRO 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 13:22" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wowalekela uhazi wana wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 13:22">mbali utajili wa wahasanyi wekiligwa wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile.<verse eid="PRO 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 13:23" />Mgunda wa ngayengaye wodaha kulava ndiya nyingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 13:23">mbali wabamanyi wowahoka ndiya izo.<verse eid="PRO 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 13:24" />Wanhu hawawalanha wanawo wowehila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 13:24">mbali wanhu wowazuma wanawo wowalonda.<verse eid="PRO 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 13:25" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile woja mbaka wokwiguta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 13:25">mbali zinda za wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile zosafagila kwa nzala.<verse eid="PRO 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="PRO 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 14:1" />Muke mbala kogangamiza mzengo wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:1">mbali muke mbozi koutula mzengo wake kwa makono yake mwenyewo.<verse eid="PRO 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 14:2" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile womdumba Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:2">mbali wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile womzeha Mulungu.<verse eid="PRO 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 14:3" />Wabozi watatali wotagusigwa kwa mbuli zawo za magoda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:3">mbali mbuli za wanhu wabala zowakaliza.<verse eid="PRO 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 14:4" />One habule ng'ombe wa kulima, madungu yokuwa yabule chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:4">mbali kwa nguvu za ng'ombe wa kulima ndiya yokuwa nyingi.<verse eid="PRO 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 14:5" />Msindila yokwaminika halonga uvwizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:5">mbali msindila wa uvwizi kolonga uvwizi.<verse eid="PRO 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 14:6" />Wehulaji wozahila ubala na hawaupata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:6">mbali wanhu wovimanya wahuha kuifunza.<verse eid="PRO 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 14:7" />Sekeuihanganye na munhu mbozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:7">kwaviya hadaha kukulongela mbuli za umanyi.<verse eid="PRO 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 14:8" />Wanhu wabala wogesa mbuli zawo ziwotenda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:8">mbali ubozi wa wabozi wowavwizila wenyewo.<verse eid="PRO 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 14:9" />Wabozi watatali wosekelela kutenda uhasanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:9">mbali unovu wopatika kwa wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile.<verse eid="PRO 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 14:10" />Moyo woumanya usungu wake wenyewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:10">habule munhu imwenga yodaha kudeng'helela hamwe nawo.<verse eid="PRO 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 14:11" />Kaye za wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile zizabomoligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:11">mbali mahema ya wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile yezagangamala.<verse eid="PRO 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 14:12" />Kuna nzila yoiwoneka inoga kwa munhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:12">mbali kuuhelelo yogala ifa.<verse eid="PRO 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 14:13" />Usungu wodaha kufisigwa muna ziseko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:13">na uhelelo wa deng'ho wodaha kuwa usungu.<verse eid="PRO 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 14:14" />Wanhu watatali wezalihigwa kwa mbuli zawo zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:14">wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wezagwekigwa.<verse eid="PRO 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 14:15" />Wanhu hawavimanyile wohuwila chila chinhu chiwolongeligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:15">mbali wanhu wabala wolola goya ugenzi wawo.<verse eid="PRO 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 14:16" />Wanhu wabala womdumba Mndewa Mulungu na woyepula kutenda mbuli za mdukula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:16">mbali wabozi wokwehula mbuli zose.<verse eid="PRO 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 14:17" />Wanhu wopata ludoko himahima wotenda mbuli za chibozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:17">wanhu waselesi wokwihiligwa.<verse eid="PRO 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 14:18" />Wanhu hawavimanyile wohazi ubozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:18">mbali wabala woyawalizigwa makombelo ya umanyi muna yamatwi yawo fana gweko.<verse eid="PRO 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 14:19" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wezatumbala mavindi haulongozi ha wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:19">na wanhu wehi wezatumbala mavindi hana zinyivi za wanhu wanogile.<verse eid="PRO 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 14:20" />Ngayengaye hawalondigwa mbaka na wakaya wayawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:20">mbali matajili wana wambwiya wengi.<verse eid="PRO 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 14:21" />Wanhu wowehula wakaya wayawo wotenda uhasanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:21">mbali watemeligwa mate wanhu waja wowawonela ubazi wanhu wolonda kutazigwa.<verse eid="PRO 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 14:22" />Vino wanhu woilunga kutenda mbuli zihile hawabananga?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:22">Mbali wanhu wogesa mbuli zinogile wolondigwa na wamwenga na wokwaminika.<verse eid="PRO 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 14:23" />Usang'hano wowose uhatendigwa kwa kuiyoha wogala faida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:23">mbali kulonga muhala kogala ungayengaye.<verse eid="PRO 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 14:24" />Kombelo da wanhu wabala ni vinhu vawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:24">mbali ubozi wa wabozi wolela ubozi.<verse eid="PRO 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 14:25" />Msindila wa kweli kokombola ugima wa wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:25">mbali msindila wa uvwizi kolonga uvwizi.<verse eid="PRO 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 14:26" />Wanhu womdumba Mndewa Mulungu wogangamala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:26">na wanawo wezakuwa na hanhu ha kukimbilila.<verse eid="PRO 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 14:27" />Kumdumba Mndewa Mulungu kulinga fana nzasa igala ugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:27">muladi kuyepula na mitego ya ifa.<verse eid="PRO 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 14:28" />Mfalume yahawatawala wanhu wengi kotogozigwa na wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:28">na bila kuwatawala wanhu mkulu kokwaga.<verse eid="PRO 14:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 14:29" />Wanhu wokalama kupata ludoko wovimanya ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:29">mbali wanhu wopata ludoko himahima wolagusa ubozi.<verse eid="PRO 14:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 14:30" />Moyo wili tindiwalo wowing'ha ugima lukuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:30">mbali migongo yotenda lukuli lusoke.<verse eid="PRO 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 14:31" />Wanhu wowawonela ngayengaye womzeha mulumbaji wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:31">mbali wanhu wowawonela ubazi wanhu wolonda kutazigwa wamuhishimu Mulungu.<verse eid="PRO 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 14:32" />Wanhu wehi wonangigwa kwa sang'hano zawo zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:32">mbali muna iifa wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wopata kimbililo.<verse eid="PRO 14:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 14:33" />Ubala wokala muna imizoyo ya wanhu wovimanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:33">mbali hazimanyika kwa wabozi.<verse eid="PRO 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PRO 14:34" />Mbuli zinogile zowenula wanhu wa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:34">mbali uhasanyi wogala chinyala kwa wanhu wose.<verse eid="PRO 14:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PRO 14:35" />Mfalume konogelwa na msang'hani mbala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 14:35">mbali komuwonela ludoko munhu yotenda mbuli za chinyala.<verse eid="PRO 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="PRO 15" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 15:1" />Kwidika kwa uhole kogalula ludoko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:1">mbali mbuli zihile zoguma ludoko.<verse eid="PRO 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 15:2" />Wabala wahalonga, wanhu wamwenga wolonda kuvimanya ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:2">mbali wabozi wolonga mbuli za chibozi.<verse eid="PRO 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 15:3" />Meso ya Mndewa Mulungu yowona chila hanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:3">yolola wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile na wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile.<verse eid="PRO 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 15:4" />Mbuli zinogile zogala ugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:4">mbali mbuli za uvwizi zogala mawine muna umoyo.<verse eid="PRO 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 15:5" />Wabozi watatali wolema kuzumigwa na tati zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:5">mbali wanhu wotogola kuzumigwa, wolagusa ubala.<verse eid="PRO 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 15:6" />Kaye za wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile zina ngama nyingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:6">mbali wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wogobola magayo.<verse eid="PRO 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 15:7" />Milomo ya wanhu wabala yopwililisa umanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:7">mbali mizoyo ya wanhu wabozi haili ivo bule.<verse eid="PRO 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 15:8" />Mndewa Mulungu kokwihila nhambiko za wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:8">mbali kodeng'helela wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile viwompula.<verse eid="PRO 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 15:9" />Mndewa Mulungu koyehila malungilo ya wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:9">mbali kowalonda wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile.<verse eid="PRO 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 15:10" />Wanhu woleka nzila ya kweli wezatagusigwa ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:10">na wanhu wolema kuzumigwa wezadanganika.<verse eid="PRO 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 15:11" />One Mndewa Mulungu kovimanya kuzimu na kombo da kunangigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:11">vino magesa ya wanhu yodahaze kuifisa haulongozi wake?<verse eid="PRO 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 15:12" />Wehulaji hawalonda wanhu wowazuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:12">na hawahita kwa wanhu wabala.<verse eid="PRO 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 15:13" />Moyo wili na deng'ho wotenda chihanga chisamhuke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:13">mbali mawine ya moyo yolugalila luholozi lukulu.<verse eid="PRO 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 15:14" />Moyo wa munhu yeli na nzewele wozahila umanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:14">mbali mulomo wa mbozi woja ubozi.<verse eid="PRO 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 15:15" />Siku zose za munhu yogaya ziha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:15">mbali siku za munhu yeli na moyo usamhuke ni dugila.<verse eid="PRO 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 15:16" />Muhavu uwe ngayengaye na kumdumba Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:16">kufosa kuwa na utajili na magayo.<verse eid="PRO 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 15:17" />Muhavu kuja bwasi hamwe na wanhu wouwalonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:17">kufosa kuja nyama ya ndama yanenehe hamwe na wanhu wouwehila.<verse eid="PRO 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 15:18" />Wanhu wowona ludoko himahima wokong'hela ndwagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:18">mbali wanhu wokalama kuwona ludoko wohoza ndwagi.<verse eid="PRO 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 15:19" />Nzila ya munhu mbwa izibigwa na miwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:19">mbali nzila ya munhu yotenda mbuli zinogile ni kulugumbi dinogile.<verse eid="PRO 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 15:20" />Wana wabala wowatenda tati zawo wadeng'helele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:20">mbali wabozi wowehila mami zawo.<verse eid="PRO 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 15:21" />Ubozi wowatenda wabozi wadeng'helele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:21">mbali wanhu wovimanya wogenda muna zinzila zigoloke.<verse eid="PRO 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 15:22" />Malungilo hayafikizigwa kwa ichimu cha kupuwa magesa yanogile ya wanhu wamwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:22">mbali kuhawa na magesa mengi yanogile yofikizigwa.<verse eid="PRO 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 15:23" />Kwidika kunogile kowadeng'heleza wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:23">na mbuli inogile ng'hani yolongigwa lusita lufaya.<verse eid="PRO 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 15:24" />Wanhu wabala wogenda muna inzila yoihita kuugima, muladi sekewahite kuzimu.<verse eid="PRO 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 15:25" />Mndewa Mulungu kobomola kaye za wanhu weli na magoda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:25">mbali kokaliza mhaka za wagane.<verse eid="PRO 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 15:26" />Mndewa Mulungu kokwihila magesa ya wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:26">mbali konogelwa na mbuli za kuwataza wamwenga.<verse eid="PRO 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 15:27" />Wanhu waselesi wowagalila ndugu zawo magayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:27">mbali wanhu wokwihila lushwa wezakuwa wagima.<verse eid="PRO 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 15:28" />Mizoyo ya wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile yogesa kwidika voilondeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:28">mbali milomo ya wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile yolonga mbuli zihile.<verse eid="PRO 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 15:29" />Mndewa Mulungu heli habehi na wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:29">mbali kotegeleza wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile viwopula.<verse eid="PRO 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 15:30" />Chihanga chihasamhuka chotenda moyo udeng'helele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:30">na mbuli zinogile zosangalaza mavuha.<verse eid="PRO 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 15:31" />Wanhu wotegeleza ndagilizi zigala ugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:31">wezakala hamwe na wanhu wabala.<verse eid="PRO 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 15:32" />Wanhu wolema kuzumigwa woyehula wenyewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:32">mbali wanhu wose wotogola kuzumigwa wopata umanyi.<verse eid="PRO 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 15:33" />Uhamdumba Mndewa Mulungu kwizaifunza ubala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 15:33">na unyendanyenda womulongolela hishima.<verse eid="PRO 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="PRO 16" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 16:1" />Wanhu woilunga muna imizoyo yawo mbuli ya kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:1">mbali Mndewa Mulungu koweng'ha mbuli za kulonga.<verse eid="PRO 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 16:2" />Wanhu wowona nzila zawo zinoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:2">mbali Mndewa Mulungu kolinga mihe ya wanhu.<verse eid="PRO 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 16:3" />Muhuwile Mndewa Mulungu kwa chila chiulonda kutenda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:3">na chila chiuilungile chizatendeka.<verse eid="PRO 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 16:4" />Mndewa Mulungu kotenda chila chinhu fana viyailungile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:4">hata wanhu watenda mbuli zihile kwa siku ya kunangigwa.<verse eid="PRO 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 16:5" />Mndewa Mulungu kowehila wanhu weli na mizoyo ya magoda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:5">kweli hezaleka kuwatagusa.<verse eid="PRO 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 16:6" />Uhasanyi wosegezigwa kwa ulondo wa kufunya umoyo na uwaminika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:6">wanhu woyepula kutenda mbuli zihile kwa kumdumba Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="PRO 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 16:7" />Mndewa Mulungu yahanogelwa na ugenzi wa munhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:7">kowatenda wehi wake wakale nayo kwa tindiwalo.<verse eid="PRO 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 16:8" />Muhavu kuwa ngayengaye hamwe na kutenda mbuli zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:8">kufosa kuwa na vinhu vingi hamwe na kutenda mbuli hazifaya.<verse eid="PRO 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 16:9" />Wanhu woilunga muna imizoyo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:9">mbali Mndewa Mulungu niiyo yowalanguliza.<verse eid="PRO 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 16:10" />Mfalume kolonga kwa kulangulizigwa na Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:10">na mulomo wake wohumiza voilondeka.<verse eid="PRO 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 16:11" />Ningo zigoloke zolawa kwa Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:11">mabwe yose ya kulingila kayatenda yeye.<verse eid="PRO 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 16:12" />Wafalume wokwihila kutenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:12">kwaviya chigoda cha chifalume chogangamizigwa kwa kutenda mbuli zinogile.<verse eid="PRO 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 16:13" />Wafalume wowadeng'helela wanhu wolonga ukweli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:13">na wowalonda wanhu wolonga mbuli zigoloke.<verse eid="PRO 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 16:14" />Ludoko lwa mfalume lulinga fana usenga wa ifa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:14">mbali wanhu wabala wezaluhoza.<verse eid="PRO 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 16:15" />Chihanga cha mfalume chihasamhuka, kuna ugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:15">kulondigwa nayo kulinga fana mvula lusita lwa masika.<verse eid="PRO 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 16:16" />Ubala unoga kufosa zahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:16">na kuvimanya kunoga kufosa kupata hela.<verse eid="PRO 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 16:17" />Nzila ng'hulu ya wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile ni kuyepula na wihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:17">wanhu wokaliza nzila zawo wokaliza ugima wawo.<verse eid="PRO 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 16:18" />Magoda yolongolela kunangigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:18">wanhu woiwona wakulu wolongolela kugwa.<verse eid="PRO 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 16:19" />Muhavu uwe mnyendanyenda hamwe na wanhu weli ngayengaye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:19">kufosa kuigolela mateka na wanhu weli na magoda.<verse eid="PRO 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 16:20" />Wanhu wose wotogola kufunzigwa wamweda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:20">na wamweda wanhu womuhuwila Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="PRO 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 16:21" />Wanhu wabala wotangigwa wavimanyile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:21">na mbuli zili mulile zowakwenhusa wanhu habehi.<verse eid="PRO 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 16:22" />Umanyi ni nzasa ya ugima kwa wanhu wowose welinawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:22">mbali wabozi watatali wotagusigwa kwa ubozi wawo.<verse eid="PRO 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 16:23" />Mizoyo ya wanhu wabala yolanguliza milomo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:23">na yokongeza umulile muna yamafundizo yawo.<verse eid="PRO 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 16:24" />Mbuli zinogile zilinga fana sega da uki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:24">zamulile muna umoyo na zohonya lukuli.<verse eid="PRO 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 16:25" />Kuna nzila yoiwoneka inoga kwa munhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:25">mbali kuuhelelo yogala ifa.<verse eid="PRO 16:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 16:26" />Nzala yowatenda wasang'hani waiyohe kusang'hana usang'hano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:26">kwaviya nzala yawo yowatenda wagendelele.<verse eid="PRO 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 16:27" />Wanhu wehi wolonda kuwagaza wayawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:27">na mbuli zawo zilinga fana moto ulunguza.<verse eid="PRO 16:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 16:28" />Wadelenya wokong'hela ndwagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:28">na wadesi wowapwililisa wambwiya zawo.<verse eid="PRO 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 16:29" />Wanhu wokalika wowavwizila wayawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:29">na wowalongoza kuna inzila ihile.<verse eid="PRO 16:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 16:30" />Wanhu wofunyiza woilungila mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:30">na wanhu wowang'ong'a wamwenga wogesa kutenda mbuli zihile.<verse eid="PRO 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 16:31" />Uhenga ni kombelo da ukulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:31">dopatika kwa kutenda mbuli zinogile.<verse eid="PRO 16:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 16:32" />Wanhu wokalama kupata ludoko wanoga kufosa magalu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:32">na wanhu wolukimilila ludoko lwawo wanoga kufosa wanhu wosola bululu.<verse eid="PRO 16:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 16:33" />Wanhu wotowa mhiya kwa kupigisa vibwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 16:33">mbali Mndewa Mulungu yaidumwe iyo yosagula chiya chondachilawilile.<verse eid="PRO 16:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="PRO 17" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 17:1" />Muhavu uje gate dinyalile kuno moyo uhola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:1">kufosa kukala kaye ya dugila ili na ndwagi.<verse eid="PRO 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 17:2" />Msang'hani mbala kezamtawala mwana yoguma chinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:2">na kezahazi hamwe nayo fana ndugu yake.<verse eid="PRO 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 17:3" />Zahabu na hela vosunhigwa muna umoto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:3">mbali Mndewa Mulungu koisafya mizoyo ya wanhu.<verse eid="PRO 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 17:4" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wotegeleza uvwizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:4">wavwizi wotegeleza ng'hani mbuli zihile zilongigwa.<verse eid="PRO 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 17:5" />Wanhu wowaseka ngayengaye womuliga mulumbaji wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:5">na wanhu wodeng'helela ndilo wezatagusigwa.<verse eid="PRO 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 17:6" />Walala woigodela wazukulu zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:6">na wana woigodela tata na mama.<verse eid="PRO 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 17:7" />Mbuli zinogile hazifaya muna imilomo ya wabozi womwehula Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:7">iviya mbuli za uvwizi hazifaya muna imilomo ya watawala.<verse eid="PRO 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 17:8" />Wanhu wolava lushwa woiwona fana mhinga yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:8">wohuwila kuwa wodaha kutenda mbuli yoyose iwolonda.<verse eid="PRO 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 17:9" />Wanhu wolekelela uhasanyi wogangamiza ulondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:9">mbali wanhu wobwelela kubananga wowagola mbwiya wa habehi.<verse eid="PRO 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 17:10" />Kuwakalikila wanhu wovimanya kofaya ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:10">kufosa kuwalanha wabozi miyanza gana.<verse eid="PRO 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 17:11" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wolonda kumuleka Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:11">ivo msenga msede kezatumigwa kumwawo.<verse eid="PRO 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 17:12" />Muhavu uiting'hane na dubu zike yoyahokigwe wanage</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:12">kufosa kuiting'hana na wabozi muna uubozi wawo.<verse eid="PRO 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 17:13" />Wihi hawizasegela muna zikaye za wanhu woliha mbuli zihile kwa mbuli zinogile.<verse eid="PRO 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 17:14" />Kwandusa ndwagi kulinga fana kutobola nzokwe za mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:14">ivo lekeni ndwagi izo ing'hali hamunaisovula.<verse eid="PRO 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 17:15" />Kuwapeta wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile kuwa watenda mbuli zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:15">na kuwatagusa wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:15">Mndewa Mulungu kowehila wawo wose.<verse eid="PRO 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 17:16" />Hela haiwafaya wabozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:16">kwaviya hawalonda ubala.<verse eid="PRO 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 17:17" />Mbwiya kolonda siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:17">na ndugu kelekigwa muladi kutaza siku za magayo.<verse eid="PRO 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 17:18" />Wabozi woilaha kuwalihila wanhu wamwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:18">na kuwekila chilagano wakaya wayawo.<verse eid="PRO 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 17:19" />Wanhu wolonda ndwagi wolonda uhasanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:19">na wanhu woigoda wozahila kunangigwa.<verse eid="PRO 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 17:20" />Wanhu watatali hawezapata mbuli zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:20">na wanhu wolonga uvwizi wogaya.<verse eid="PRO 17:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 17:21" />Wana wabozi wogala lugano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:21">na tata za wana wabozi hawadeng'helela.<verse eid="PRO 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 17:22" />Moyo usangalale ni dawa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:22">mbali moyo unyululuka wonyaza mavuha.<verse eid="PRO 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 17:23" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wotogola lushwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:23">muladi kwagiza nzila igoloke.<verse eid="PRO 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 17:24" />Wanhu wovimanya wolola ubala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:24">mbali meso ya wabozi yozunguluka mbaka kuna uhelelo wa isi.<verse eid="PRO 17:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 17:25" />Wana wabozi ni usungu kwa tati zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:25">na kwa mami zawo waweleke.<verse eid="PRO 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 17:26" />Havinogile kuwaja nguku wanhu welibule ubananzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:26">na havinogile kuwalanha wakulu kwa sang'hano zawo zinogile.<verse eid="PRO 17:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 17:27" />Wanhu weli na nzewele hawalonga bila kugesa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:27">iviya wanhu wovimanya wolonga mbuli zawo kwa kuteganya.<verse eid="PRO 17:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 17:28" />Hata wabozi watatali wahanyamala wowoneka wabala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 17:28">na wanhu weli na umanyi wozikimilila ndimi zawo.<verse eid="PRO 17:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="PRO 18" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 18:1" />Wanhu woibagula wotenda viwolonda wenyewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 18:1">wolema mbuli za ubala.<verse eid="PRO 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 18:2" />Wabozi hawalonda kuvimanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 18:2">mbali wodeng'helela kulonga magesa yawo.<verse eid="PRO 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 18:3" />Wanhu wamwenga wowehula waja wotenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 18:3">wanhu viwotenda mbuli za kuguma chinyala wozehigwa.<verse eid="PRO 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 18:4" />Mbuli za wabala zilinga fana nzasa za mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 18:4">na zilinga fana mazi yamemile.<verse eid="PRO 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 18:5" />Sekeuleme kuwatagusa wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 18:5">hebu kuwema haki wanhu welibule ubananzi.<verse eid="PRO 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 18:6" />Mbuli za wanhu wabozi zogala ndwagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 18:6">milomo yawo wenyewo yowahonza walanhigwe.<verse eid="PRO 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 18:7" />Milomo ya wabozi yowananga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 18:7">na mbuli zawo zilinga fana mtego wa kuinamata wenyewo.<verse eid="PRO 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 18:8" />Mbuli za wadesi zilinga fana ndiya zili mulile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 18:8">zokwingila mgati ng'hani mwa lukuli.<verse eid="PRO 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 18:9" />Wanhu wabwa ni ndugu wa waja wonanga.<verse eid="PRO 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 18:10" />Mndewa Mulungu kalinga fana mhongono igangamale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 18:10">na wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wokimbilila kumwake wakakale goya.<verse eid="PRO 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 18:11" />Vinhu va matajili vilinga fana bululu dili na mhongono,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 18:11">wogesa vizawakaliza.<verse eid="PRO 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 18:12" />Wanhu weli na magoda wezanangigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 18:12">mbali wanhu woinyendanyenda wezahishimigwa.<verse eid="PRO 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 18:13" />Wanhu wokwidika bila kutegeleza ni wabozi na woguma chinyala.<verse eid="PRO 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 18:14" />Muhe wa munhu wodaha kuufunyila umoyo utamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 18:14">mbali habule munhu yodaha kuufunyila umoyo ihawa moyo wake ulumizigwa.<verse eid="PRO 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 18:15" />Wanhu weli na nzewele wolonda kuifunza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 18:15">na wanhu wabala wozahila umanyi.<verse eid="PRO 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 18:16" />Uhalonda kuiting'hana na munhu mkulu, umgalile chitumetume.<verse eid="PRO 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 18:17" />Munhu yokwandusa kuigombela kowoneka kabule ubananzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 18:17">mbaka yeze munhu iyagombile nayo yamuuze.<verse eid="PRO 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 18:18" />Mhiya yokomeleza kuibishila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 18:18">na yowalamula wanhu waidi weli na nguvu wogomba.<verse eid="PRO 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 18:19" />Vidala kuilumba na mbwiya youmbanange kufosa kutula mhongono,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 18:19">iviya kuibishila kulinga fana nyivi za mhongono zili na mhalalingwe.<verse eid="PRO 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 18:20" />Zinda za wanhu zokwiguta mbuli zilawa muna imilomo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 18:20">wezakwiguta mbuli ziwolonga.<verse eid="PRO 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 18:21" />Lulimi lodaha kugala ifa hebu ugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 18:21">waja wolusang'hanila wezakuja matunda yake.<verse eid="PRO 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 18:22" />Munhu yopata muke kopata chinhu chinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 18:22">nayo kotogoligwa na Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="PRO 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 18:23" />Ngayengaye kopula yawoneligwe ubazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 18:23">mbali tajili kokwidika kwa kukalika.<verse eid="PRO 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 18:24" />Wambwiya wengi wodaha kumbananga miyawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 18:24">mbali kuna mbwiya yoilumba na munhu kufosa ndugu.<verse eid="PRO 18:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="PRO 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 19:1" />Muhavu wanhu ngayengaye wokala bila ubananzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:1">kufosa wabozi wolonga uvwizi.<verse eid="PRO 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 19:2" />Havinogile wanhu kuiyoha bila umanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:2">iviya kutausa na kwaga.<verse eid="PRO 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 19:3" />Ubozi wa wanhu wowagiza wenyewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:3">mbali womuwonela ludoko Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="PRO 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 19:4" />Utajili wokongeza wambwiya wa sambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:4">mbali ngayengaye wobaguligwa na wambwiya zawo.<verse eid="PRO 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 19:5" />Wasindila wa uvwizi wezatagusigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:5">na wanhu wolonga uvwizi hawezahonyoka.<verse eid="PRO 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 19:6" />Wanhu wengi woikombakomba kwa mtawala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:6">mbali chila munhu ni mbwiya wa munhu yolava chitumetume.<verse eid="PRO 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 19:7" />Ngayengaye wokwihiligwa na ndugu zawo wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:7">na wambwiya zawo wezawabanga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:7">Ingawa wowasondelela muladi wawapule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:7">hawapatika kokose.<verse eid="PRO 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 19:8" />Wanhu wopata ubala woilonda wawo wenyewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:8">na wanhu wokwamha umanyi wokala goya.<verse eid="PRO 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 19:9" />Wasindila wa uvwizi wezatagusigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:9">wanhu wolonga uvwizi wezanangigwa.<verse eid="PRO 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 19:10" />Wabozi hawalondeka kukala kwa madambwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:10">na watumwa hawalondeka ng'hani kuwatawala wenevale.<verse eid="PRO 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 19:11" />Wanhu wabala hawapata ludoko himahima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:11">na wanhu wolekelela uhasanyi wotogozigwa.<verse eid="PRO 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 19:12" />Ludoko lwa wafalume lulinga fana simba viyotongoloma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:12">mbali unovu wawo ulinga fana nhungwe muna yamayani.<verse eid="PRO 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 19:13" />Wana wabozi wowaguma chinyala tati zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:13">mbali wanaake weli na ndwagi walinga fana madwende ya mvula hayamala.<verse eid="PRO 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 19:14" />Kaye na vinhu ni uhazi uyopata munhu kulawa kwa tati yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:14">mbali Mndewa Mulungu muhala niiyo yomwing'ha mulume muke mbala.<verse eid="PRO 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 19:15" />Ubwa wowatenda wanhu wawone nhongo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:15">na wabwa wezawona nzala.<verse eid="PRO 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 19:16" />Wanhu wozindilila malagilizo ya Mndewa Mulungu, wezakuwa wagima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:16">mbali wanhu hawazindilila malagilizo wezadanganika.<verse eid="PRO 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 19:17" />Wanhu womuwonela ubazi ngayengaye, womwazima Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:17">nayo Mndewa Mulungu kezawaliha kwa chiya chiwatendile.<verse eid="PRO 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 19:18" />Mulamule mwanago yang'hali mdodo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:18">one hutendile ivo, mwana iyo kwizamdanganya.<verse eid="PRO 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 19:19" />Wanhu wamemile ludoko wezapata nhaguso yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:19">uhawalopola, kolondeka utende ivo kaidi.<verse eid="PRO 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 19:20" />Tegeleza ndagilizi na utogole mafundizo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:20">muladi uwe mbala siku zako zose.<verse eid="PRO 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 19:21" />Wanhu wogesa mbuli nyingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:21">mbali chiyoilunga Mndewa Mulungu niicho chondachilawilile.<verse eid="PRO 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 19:22" />Chinhu chilondeka kwa munhu ni kwaminika.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:22">Muhavu kuwa ngayengaye kufosa kuwa mvwizi.<verse eid="PRO 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 19:23" />Wanhu womdumba Mndewa Mulungu wezakala siku nyingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:23">na wezakwiguta bila kugaya.<verse eid="PRO 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 19:24" />Wanhu wamwenga wabwa ng'hani mbaka hawadaha kuja wenyewo.<verse eid="PRO 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 19:25" />Watowe wakewezi muladi wanhu hawavimanyile waifunze kuwa wabala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:25">wakalikile wanhu wovimanya, nawo wezaifunza.<verse eid="PRO 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 19:26" />Mwana yoyose yombawila tati yake na kumuwinga mami yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:26">koguma chinyala na kogala ubananzi.<verse eid="PRO 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 19:27" />Mwanangu, one uhaleka kuifunza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:27">baho kwizazimiza chiya choukalile kuchimanya.<verse eid="PRO 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 19:28" />Wasindila hawafaya wozeha nhaguso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:28">milomo ya wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile yomela uvwizi.<verse eid="PRO 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 19:29" />Nhaguso zisasaligwa kwa ichimu cha wakewezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 19:29">iviya wabozi wezalanhigwa.<verse eid="PRO 19:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="PRO 20" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 20:1" />Upele wowatenda wanhu wehuligwe na chinhu chikola chigala ndwagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:1">wanhu wokwagizigwa kwa vinhu ivo wabule ubala.<verse eid="PRO 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 20:2" />Ludoko lwa mfalume lulinga fana mbumo wa simba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:2">wanhu womtenda yehilwe wezadanganika.<verse eid="PRO 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 20:3" />Wanhu wahayepula na ndwagi wohishimigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:3">mbali wabozi watatali wolonda ndwagi.<verse eid="PRO 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 20:4" />Wanhu wabwa hawalonda kulima muna ulusita lwa kulima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:4">mbali chipindi cha kugobola wezapula na hawezapata chinhu.<verse eid="PRO 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 20:5" />Vinhu viwogesa wanhu muna imizoyo vilinga fana mazi yagidimile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:5">mbali wanhu wovimanya wovideha.<verse eid="PRO 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 20:6" />Wanhu wengi woigoda kuwa wana ulondo wa kufunya umoyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:6">mbali wanhu wadodo wokwaminika.<verse eid="PRO 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 20:7" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wokala bila ubananzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:7">na wanawo watemeligwa mate.<verse eid="PRO 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 20:8" />Mfalume yokala hana ichigoda cha kuhumiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:8">iyo kobeta wihi wose kwa meso yake.<verse eid="PRO 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 20:9" />Vino yelihi yodaha kulonga, “Niusafya moyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:9">niye nyela na nabule uhasanyi?”<verse eid="PRO 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 20:10" />Ningo za chivwizi na mhishi za chivwizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:10">Mndewa Mulungu kovihila vose vidi.<verse eid="PRO 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 20:11" />Wana womanyika kuwa wanoga hebu weha kwa chiya chiwotenda.<verse eid="PRO 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 20:12" />Gutwi dodihulika na ziso dodiwona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:12">ivo vose kavilumba Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="PRO 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 20:13" />Sekeulonde kugona, buleivo kwizakuwa ngayengaye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:13">sang'hana usang'hano na kwizapata ndiya ya kufaya.<verse eid="PRO 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 20:14" />Munhu yogula kolongelela, “Havinogile, havinogile,”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:14">mbali yahasegela koitogoza kwa kuhunguziligwa bei.<verse eid="PRO 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 20:15" />Kuna zahabu na mabwe mengi ya hela nyingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:15">mbali munhu yolonga kwa umanyi kalinga fana dibwe da hela nyingi.<verse eid="PRO 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 20:16" />Munhu yahamwikila zamana munhu hamanyika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:16">udisole walo jake kuwa lehani.<verse eid="PRO 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 20:17" />Ndiya ipatike kwa uvwizi yamulile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:17">maabaho izakuwa fana msanga muna umulomo wako.<verse eid="PRO 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 20:18" />Malungilo yanogile yotendeka kwa kutogola magesa yanogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:18">uhalonda kuitowa ng'hondo uwauze wanhu wovimanya.<verse eid="PRO 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 20:19" />Wadesi wolonga sili za wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:19">ivo uyepule na wanhu wawo.<verse eid="PRO 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 20:20" />One munhu yahamduwila tati yake hebu mami yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:20">kezadanganika fana chitasa vochizimigwa muna diziza totolo.<verse eid="PRO 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 20:21" />Uhazi upatike mwanduso himahima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:21">hawizatemeligwa mate kuuhelelo.<verse eid="PRO 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 20:22" />Sekeulonge, “Nizakuliha kwa ubananzi uno!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:22">Mgozele Mndewa Mulungu, kezakutaza.<verse eid="PRO 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 20:23" />Mndewa Mulungu kokwihila ningo za uvwizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:23">na mhishi za uvwizi hazimnogeza.<verse eid="PRO 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 20:24" />Ugenzi wa munhu wolongozigwa na Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:24">lelo munhu kodahaze kuimanya nzila yake mwenyewo?<verse eid="PRO 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 20:25" />Wanhu woilaha himahima kwa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:25">hamwande wovigesa kaidi vilaho vawo.<verse eid="PRO 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 20:26" />Mfalume mbala kobeta wanhu wehi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:26">kowatagusa bila ubazi wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile.<verse eid="PRO 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 20:27" />Muhe wa munhu ulinga fana chitasa cha Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:27">wopekula chila chinhu chili muna umoyo wake.<verse eid="PRO 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 20:28" />Ulondo na waminika womtenda mfalume yakale goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:28">kufosela ulondo wa kufunya umoyo, chigoda chake cha chifalume chogangamala.<verse eid="PRO 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 20:29" />Wabwanga woigodela nguvu zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:29">na walala woigodela uhenga.<verse eid="PRO 20:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 20:30" />Kulanhigwa kowatenda wanhu waleke kutenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 20:30">na kutowigwa kowatenda wanhu watende mbuli zinogile.<verse eid="PRO 20:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="PRO 21" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 21:1" />Moyo wa mfalume wokuwa muna umkono wa Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:1">kouhindula kokose koyolonda fana mfulunda wa mazi.<verse eid="PRO 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 21:2" />Wanhu wowona chiwosang'hana chinoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:2">mbali Mndewa Mulungu kolinga mizoyo ya wanhu.<verse eid="PRO 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 21:3" />Kutenda mbuli zinogile na voilondeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:3">vomnogeza Mndewa Mulungu kufosa nhambiko.<verse eid="PRO 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 21:4" />Meso ya utatali na moyo wa magoda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:4">volagusa uhasanyi wa wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile!<verse eid="PRO 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 21:5" />Malungilo ya wanhu woiyoha yowatenda wapate vinhu vingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:5">mbali wanhu wotenda himahima wezakuwa ngayengaye.<verse eid="PRO 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 21:6" />Vinhu vipatike kwa kulonga uvwizi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:6">vilinga fana kungugu dodifosa himahima na mtego ukoma.<verse eid="PRO 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 21:7" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wezanangigwa kwa ichimu cha udugi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:7">kwaviya wolema kutenda voilondeka.<verse eid="PRO 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 21:8" />Nzila za wahasanyi zaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:8">mbali sang'hano za wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile zigoloka.<verse eid="PRO 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 21:9" />Muhavu kukala kuna ichisuwili cha kaye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:9">kufosa kukala kaye imwe na muke yeli na ndwagi.<verse eid="PRO 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 21:10" />Wanhu wehi wowolonda ng'hani kutenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:10">hawawawonela ubazi wakaya wayawo.<verse eid="PRO 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 21:11" />Uhawatagusa wanhu wolonga ugongo, wanhu hawavimanyile wezapata ubala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:11">uhawafunza wanhu wabala, wezadaha kuvimanya.<verse eid="PRO 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 21:12" />Mulungu kozimanya mbuli zitendeka muna zikaye za wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:12">nayo kezawananga.<verse eid="PRO 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 21:13" />Wanhu wahasita magutwi yawo muladi sekewawahulike ngayengaye viwolila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:13">nawo wezalila na hawezategelezigwa.<verse eid="PRO 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 21:14" />Chitumetume chilavigwa kwa mvisa chohunguza ludoko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:14">na lushwa ifisike yokomeleza ludoko.<verse eid="PRO 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 21:15" />Kuhumizigwa ni deng'ho da wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:15">mbali kowadumbiza wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile.<verse eid="PRO 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 21:16" />Wanhu wokwaga kulawa muna inzila ya ubala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:16">wezakala hamwe na wanhu wadanganike.<verse eid="PRO 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 21:17" />Wanhu wolonda madambwa wezakuwa ngayengaye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:17">wanhu wolonda upele na mavuta ya zaituni, hewezakuwa matajili.<verse eid="PRO 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 21:18" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wezagaya badala ya wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:18">na wanhu weli siyo waminika wezatagusigwa badala ya wanhu wotenda voilondeka.<verse eid="PRO 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 21:19" />Muhavu kukala muna dibwilingu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:19">kufosa kukala na muke mtatali yeli na ndwagi.<verse eid="PRO 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 21:20" />Wanhu wabala wokwika ngama ya ndiya na mavuta ya zaituni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:20">mbali wanhu wabozi wogegeda vinhu vose viwelinavo.<verse eid="PRO 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 21:21" />Wanhu woiyoha kutenda mbuli zinogile na kuwalonda wayawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:21">wezahishimigwa na wezakala siku nyingi na wezapata vinhu viwolonda.<verse eid="PRO 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 21:22" />Wanhu wabala wodaha kuditowa bululu da wanhu weli na nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:22">na kuzigwisa mhongono zowozihuwila.<verse eid="PRO 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 21:23" />Wanhu wokaliza milomo yawo na ndimi zawo woikaliza na magayo.<verse eid="PRO 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 21:24" />Wanhu watatali weli na magoda wotangigwa wakewezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:24">na wotenda mbuli za magoda.<verse eid="PRO 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 21:25" />Wanhu wabwa wezakomigwa na nzala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:25">kwaviya hawalonda kusang'hana usang'hano.<verse eid="PRO 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 21:26" />Wabwa womelela mate siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:26">mbali wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wolava kwa makono maidi.<verse eid="PRO 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 21:27" />Mndewa Mulungu kokwihila nhambiko za wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:27">zozilavigwa kwa lungilo dihile.<verse eid="PRO 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 21:28" />Wasindila wa uvwizi wezanangigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:28">mbali wanhu wohulika wezalonga mbuli zozikala.<verse eid="PRO 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 21:29" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile woitenda wanoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:29">mbali wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wogesa nzila zawo.<verse eid="PRO 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 21:30" />Ubala na umanyi na malungilo ya wanhu, havizadaha kuihuma na Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="PRO 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 21:31" />Falasi wosasaligwa kwa ng'hondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 21:31">mbali uhumi walawa kwa Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="PRO 21:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="PRO 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 22:1" />Kuhishimigwa kunoga kufosa kuwa na vinhu vingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:1">iviya kunoga kufosa hela na zahabu.<verse eid="PRO 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 22:2" />Mndewa Mulungu kawalumba wanhu wose, matajili na ngayengaye.<verse eid="PRO 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 22:3" />Wanhu weli na nzewele wahawona ng'hondo woifisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:3">mbali wanhu hawavimanyile wogendelela kuulongozi na ng'hondo iyo yowagaza.<verse eid="PRO 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 22:4" />Unyendanyenda na kumdumba Mndewa Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:4">vogala utajili na hishima na ugima.<verse eid="PRO 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 22:5" />Zinzila za wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile zimema miwa na mitego,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:5">mbali wanhu wokaliza ugima wawo wokala kutali nayo.<verse eid="PRO 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 22:6" />Wafunze wana kutenda voilondeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:6">nawo hawezaleka kutenda ivo hata wahalala.<verse eid="PRO 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 22:7" />Matajili wowatawala ngayengaye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:7">na wanhu wokwazima wokuwa watumwa wa wanhu wawazime.<verse eid="PRO 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 22:8" />Wanhu wohanda mbuli zihile wezagobola magayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:8">na mibalati ya ludoko lwawo izanangigwa.<verse eid="PRO 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 22:9" />Wanhu wolava kwa makono maidi wezatemeligwa mate,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:9">kwaviya woweng'ha ndiya ngayengaye.<verse eid="PRO 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 22:10" />Muwinge munhu mkewezi, ndwagi zizamala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:10">baho maligo na chinyala vizasegela.<verse eid="PRO 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 22:11" />Wanhu weli na moyo welile na wolonga mbuli za ubazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:11">wezakuwa wambwiya wa mfalume.<verse eid="PRO 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 22:12" />Mndewa Mulungu kowakaliza wanhu wovimanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:12">mbali kozilema mbuli za wanhu wavwizi.<verse eid="PRO 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 22:13" />Munhu mbwa kolonga, “Kunze kuna simba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:13">nizakomigwa kuna inzila.”<verse eid="PRO 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 22:14" />Mbuli za muke mgoni zilinga fana kombo tali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:14">wanhu wowoneligwa ludoko na Mndewa Mulungu wezakwingila muna dikombo ijo.<verse eid="PRO 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 22:15" />Ubozi wamunamumoyo wa chila mwana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:15">mbali balati da kulamula dizauwinga.<verse eid="PRO 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 22:16" />Wanhu wowabamanya ngayengaye muladi wapate vinhu vingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:16">na wanhu woweng'ha vitumetume matajili, wose wezakuwa ngayengaye.<verse eid="PRO 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Masimwe ya ubala</para>
  <para style="s2">Simwe 1</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 22:17" />Kinga digutwi utegeleze mbuli za wanhu wabala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:17">moyo wako uhulike mbuli zonikufunza,<verse eid="PRO 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 22:18" />kwaviya zonogeza uhazika muna umoyo wako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:18">na zose uwe nazo muna umulomo wako.<verse eid="PRO 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 22:19" />Leka diyelo nikufunze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:19">muladi umuhuwile Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="PRO 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 22:20" />Nikwandikila masimwe malongo matatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:20">masimwe ya magesa yanogile na umanyi,<verse eid="PRO 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 22:21" />muladi uvimanye mbuli za kweli na za kwaminika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:21">na uhauzigwa udahe kwidika voilondeka.<verse eid="PRO 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Simwe 2</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 22:22" />Sekeuwabamanya ngayengaye kwaviya ni ngayengaye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:22">na sekeuwazehe wanhu wolonda kutazigwa kuna ivitala,<verse eid="PRO 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 22:23" />kwaviya Mndewa Mulungu kezawagombela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:23">na kezawahoka ugima waja wowabamanya ngayengaye.<verse eid="PRO 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Simwe 3</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 22:24" />Sekeuwe mbwiya wa wanhu wowona ludoko himahima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:24">na sekewiilumbe na wanhu wahuhile kupata ludoko.<verse eid="PRO 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 22:25" />One uhaifunza ugenzi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:25">kwizanamata muna umtego.<verse eid="PRO 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Simwe 4</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 22:26" />Sekewike lehani kwa madeni ya wanhu wamwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:26">na sekeuwekile zamana wanhu.<verse eid="PRO 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 22:27" />One uhawa kwabule chinhu cha kuliha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:27">komwa jako dizasoligwa lusita vondaugone.<verse eid="PRO 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Simwe 5</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 22:28" />Sekeusegeze mhaka ya umwaka</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:28">yoikigwe na wasaho zako.<verse eid="PRO 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Simwe 6</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 22:29" />Vino kowawona wanhu wosang'hana usang'hano wawo vinogile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:29">Wawo wezawasang'hanila wafalume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 22:29">hawezawasang'hanila wanhu chaka.<verse eid="PRO 22:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="PRO 23" />
  <para style="s2">Simwe 7</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 23:1" />Uhakala hasi kuja ndiya hamwe na mtawala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:1">uteganye muladi utende voilondeka.<verse eid="PRO 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 23:2" />One uhawa na nzala ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:2">uleke umelo wako wa kuja ndiya.<verse eid="PRO 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 23:3" />Sekeulonde kuja ndiya zake zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:3">kwaviya ndiya izo zodaha kukuvwizila.<verse eid="PRO 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Simwe 8</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 23:4" />Sekeugaiye kupata utajili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:4">na sekeugese ng'hani kupata vinhu vingi.<verse eid="PRO 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 23:5" />Kobalika na utajili wosegela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:5">wokuwa fana upata mabawa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:5">woguluka fana masumula na kwaga.<verse eid="PRO 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Simwe 9</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 23:6" />Sekeuje ndiya ya munhu mgila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:6">iviya sekeumelele mate ndiya zake zili mulile,<verse eid="PRO 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 23:7" />kwaviya yeye kogesa bei.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:7">Kokulongela, “Uje na ung'we,”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:7">mbali moyo wake hauli hamwe na weye.<verse eid="PRO 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 23:8" />Kwizadeka ndiya iyo yuudile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:8">na kwizakwagiza mbuli zako za kumtogoza.<verse eid="PRO 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Simwe 10</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 23:9" />Sekeulonge na wanhu wabozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:9">kwaviya wezazizeha mbuli zako za umanyi.<verse eid="PRO 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Simwe 11</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 23:10" />Sekeusegeze dibwe da mhaka da umwaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:10">na sekeusole migunda ya wachiwa,<verse eid="PRO 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 23:11" />kwaviya Mulungu yowalolesa kana nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:11">na kezawagombela sekeuwatende vihile.<verse eid="PRO 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Simwe 12</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 23:12" />Tegeleza mafundizo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:12">sang'hanila magutwi yako utegeleze mbuli za umanyi.<verse eid="PRO 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Simwe 13</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 23:13" />Sekeuleke kumulamula mwana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:13">uhamulanha hezadanganika.<verse eid="PRO 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 23:14" />Mulanhe na balati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:14">muladi umkombole kulawa kuzimu.<verse eid="PRO 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Simwe 14</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 23:15" />Mwanangu, one uhawa mbala, nizadeng'helela.<verse eid="PRO 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 23:16" />One uhalonga mbuli zilondeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:16">nizadeng'helela muna umoyo wangu.<verse eid="PRO 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Simwe 15</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 23:17" />Sekeuleke moyo wako uwawonele migongo wahasanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:17">mbali siku zose uiyohe kumdumba Mndewa Mulungu.<verse eid="PRO 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 23:18" />Kweli kwizagwekigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:18">na huwilo jako hadizakwaga.<verse eid="PRO 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Simwe 16</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 23:19" />Mwanangu, tegeleza na uwe na ubala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:19">ugese vinogile viya voukala.<verse eid="PRO 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 23:20" />Sekeuilumbe na wanhu wokoligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:20">hebu wanhu weli na usu wa nyama,<verse eid="PRO 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 23:21" />kwaviya wanhu wokoligwa na wamelo wokuwa ngayengaye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:21">kukukila kowavaza matambala.<verse eid="PRO 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Simwe 17</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 23:22" />Mtegeleze tati yako yakweleke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:22">na sekeumwehule mami yako yahalala.<verse eid="PRO 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 23:23" />Gula ukweli na sekeuuchuuze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:23">iviya gula ubala na mafundizo na umanyi.<verse eid="PRO 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 23:24" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile, tati zawo wodeng'helela ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:24">na wanhu wowadeng'helela wanawo wabala.<verse eid="PRO 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 23:25" />Tati yako na mami yako wadeng'helele ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:25">iviya mami yako yakweleke yasekelele.<verse eid="PRO 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Simwe 18</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 23:26" />Mwanangu, kinga digutwi utegeleze vonilonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:26">na ulole chonitenda.<verse eid="PRO 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 23:27" />Mwanamke malaya kalinga fana kombo tali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:27">kowatenda walume wengile umo na wamuhasanye Mulungu.<verse eid="PRO 23:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 23:28" />Mwanamke malaya kogozela fana mbavi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:28">na kowatenda walume wengi sekewaminike.<verse eid="PRO 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Simwe 19</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 23:29" />Yelihi yogaya? Yelihi yeli na usungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:29">Yelihi yeli na ndwagi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:29">Yelihi yolongelela?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:29">Yelihi yeli na mawanga bila chimu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:29">Yelihi yeli na meso madung'hu?<verse eid="PRO 23:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 23:30" />Niiwawo wong'wa ng'hani divai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:30">wohita kuzahila divai ihanganyigwe na vilungo.<verse eid="PRO 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 23:31" />Sekeumelele mate divai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:31">voinang'hana muna ichikonha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:31">kuno yokwingila vinogile muna dimelo.<verse eid="PRO 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 23:32" />Kuuhelelo yoluma fana sungu ya zoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:32">na sungu yake ilinga fana ya zoka da muyombo.<verse eid="PRO 23:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 23:33" />Meso yako yezawona mbuli ngeni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:33">na moyo wako wizagesa mbuli za mdukula.<verse eid="PRO 23:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PRO 23:34" />Kwizakuwa fana munhu yogona muna imeli lusita lwa beho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:34">hebu fana munhu yogona uchanyha ya meli viyandusa kusegela.<verse eid="PRO 23:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PRO 23:35" />Kwizalonga, “Wanitowa mbali silumile!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:35">Wanilanha, mbali siwonile usungu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:35">Nizalamka zuwaki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 23:35">muladi nikazahile divai nikang'we kaidi?”<verse eid="PRO 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="PRO 24" />
  <para style="s2">Simwe 20</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 24:1" />Sekeuwawonele migongo wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:1">sekeulonde kuihanganya nawo,<verse eid="PRO 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 24:2" />kwaviya mizoyo yawo yogesa utatali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:2">na milomo yawo yolonga mbuli zozigala magayo.<verse eid="PRO 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Simwe 21</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 24:3" />Kaye yozengigwa kwa ubala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:3">na yogangamizigwa kwa umanyi,<verse eid="PRO 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 24:4" />na viheleto vake vomemezigwa kwa umanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:4">vomemezigwa vinhu va hela nyingi na vonogeza.<verse eid="PRO 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Simwe 22</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 24:5" />Wanhu wabala wana udahi mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:5">wanhu wovimanya wokongeza nguvu.<verse eid="PRO 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 24:6" />Ung'hali hunakwandusa ng'hondo kolondeka ugese ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:6">na hudaha kuhuma bila kupata magesa yanogile ya wanhu wamwenga.<verse eid="PRO 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Simwe 23</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 24:7" />Ubala haupatika kwa wabozi watatali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:7">na wabule mbuli za kulonga hana umting'hano.<verse eid="PRO 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Simwe 24</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 24:8" />Wanhu wogesa kutenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:8">wezatangigwa waselesi.<verse eid="PRO 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 24:9" />Wanhu wabozi wogesa kutenda uhasanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:9">wanhu wowehila waja wokwehula.<verse eid="PRO 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Simwe 25</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 24:10" />Uhabeneka moyo muna yamagayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:10">nguvu zako ndodo!<verse eid="PRO 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 24:11" />Wakombole waja wosoligwa kukomigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:11">uwalopole waja wohita kudumuligwa yamatwi.<verse eid="PRO 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 24:12" />One uhalonga, “Sivimanyile chochose,”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:12">vino Mulungu yolola muna imizoyo havimanyile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:12">Vino Mulungu yokaliza ugima wenu havimanyile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:12">Vino hezamuliha chila munhu kwa chiya chiyasang'hane?<verse eid="PRO 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Simwe 26</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 24:13" />Mwanangu, diya uki kwaviya unoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:13">uki ulawa muna dilala wamulile.<verse eid="PRO 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 24:14" />Iviya uvimanye kuwa ubala unoga fana uki kumwako.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:14">One uhapata ubala kuna huwilo da siku zikwiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:14">na huwilo jako hadizalemigwa.<verse eid="PRO 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Simwe 27</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 24:15" />Sekeusepe fana viyotenda mbavi muladi kumbawila munhu yotenda mbuli zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:15">sekeubanange kaye yake.<verse eid="PRO 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 24:16" />Kwaviya wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wogwa miyanza mingi na wokwinuka kaidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:16">mbali wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wogwisigwa na wonangigwa.<verse eid="PRO 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Simwe 28</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 24:17" />Mwihi wako yahagwa, sekeudeng'helele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:17">na one yahaikwala, moyo wako sekeusekelele.<verse eid="PRO 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 24:18" />Buleivo Mndewa Mulungu kezawona na hezanogelwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:18">kezaleka kumuwonela ludoko.<verse eid="PRO 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Simwe 29</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 24:19" />Sekeudumbe kwa ichimu cha wanhu wehi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:19">iviya sekeuwawonele migongo wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile,<verse eid="PRO 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 24:20" />kwaviya wawo wabule huwilo da siku zikwiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:20">wezadanganika fana vitasa vovizimigwa.<verse eid="PRO 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="s2">Simwe 30</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 24:21" />Mwanangu, uwadumbe Mndewa Mulungu na mfalume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:21">na sekeuihanganye na wanhu wolema kutegeleza,<verse eid="PRO 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 24:22" />kwaviya wezanangigwa kwa kusinhukila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:22">Vino yelihi yodimanya hulo dondawagale Mulungu na mfalume?<verse eid="PRO 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Masimwe yamwenga ya ubala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 24:23" />Zino iviya mbuli za wanhu wabala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:23">Havinogile kuhumiza kwa kuwonela.<verse eid="PRO 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 24:24" />Munhu yoyose yomulongela mbananzi, “Weye kwabule ubananzi,”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:24">wanhu wezamduwila na wanhu wa zisi zimwenga wezamwihila.<verse eid="PRO 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 24:25" />Mbali wanhu wondawawataguse wabananzi wezadeng'helela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:25">na Mulungu kezawatemela mate.<verse eid="PRO 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 24:26" />Kwidika voilondeka kolagusa umbwiya wa kweli.<verse eid="PRO 24:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 24:27" />Komeleza sang'hano zako za kunze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:27">sasala migunda yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:27">uhakomeleza kutenda ivo, zenga kaye yako.<verse eid="PRO 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 24:28" />Sekeumulongeleze miyago kwa mbuli haitendile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:28">iviya sekeulonge uvwizi.<verse eid="PRO 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 24:29" />Sekeulonge, “Nizamtendela fana viyanitendele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:29">nizamuliha kwa chiya chiyanitendele.”<verse eid="PRO 24:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 24:30" />Nifosa habehi na mgunda wa munhu mbwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:30">habehi na mgunda wa mizabibu wa munhu mbozi.<verse eid="PRO 24:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 24:31" />Mgunda wose umema miwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:31">ugubikigwa na masinde,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:31">na ng'huta yake ya mabwe igwa.<verse eid="PRO 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 24:32" />Muna umoyo wangu nigesa mbuli ija yoniiwone,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:32">iviya niifunza mbuli kwa icho choniwone.<verse eid="PRO 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 24:33" />Gona chidogo, kukila chidogo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:33">ibetebete makono yako uhumule chidogo.<verse eid="PRO 24:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PRO 24:34" />Maabaho ungayengaye wokwizila fana mbavi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 24:34">na kuhungukilwa kokwizila kwa kusinhukila fana munhu viyokwingila kubawa muna ikaye.<verse eid="PRO 24:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="PRO 25" />
  <para style="s">Masimwe yamwenga ya Sulemani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 25:1" />Yano iviya masimwe ya Sulemani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:1">yoyandikigwe na wanhu wa Hezekia mfalume wa isi ya Yuda.<verse eid="PRO 25:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 25:2" />Mulungu kotogozigwa kwaviya kovimanya mbuli hazimanyika kwa wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:2">mbali wafalume wotogozigwa kwa mbuli ziwodaha kufambula.<verse eid="PRO 25:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 25:3" />Mizoyo ya wafalume haipekulika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:3">ilinga fana ulanga viwili uchanyha na isi viili hasi.<verse eid="PRO 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 25:4" />Segeza unyolodo muna ihela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:4">muladi muhunzi wa hela yatende chinhu chinogile.<verse eid="PRO 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 25:5" />Msegeze haulongozi wa mfalume munhu yotenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:5">na chigoda chake cha chifalume chizagangamizigwa kwa kuhumiza voilondeka.<verse eid="PRO 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 25:6" />Sekeuitogoze mwenyewo haulongozi wa mfalume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:6">na sekewime hanhu ha walangulizi.<verse eid="PRO 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 25:7" />Muhavu yakulongele, “Izo kuno uchanyha,”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:7">kufosa kukuguma chinyala hana iwakulu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PRO 25:7" />
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:7">Mbuli zouziwone kwa meso yako,<verse eid="PRO 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 25:8" />sekeulopole kuzigala kuna ichitala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:8">Kwaviya kwizatenda choni kuuhelelo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:8">one msindila wako yahakuguma chinyala?<verse eid="PRO 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 25:9" />Uhaibishila na miyago,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:9">sekeumulongele munhu imwenga mbuli imuibishile,<verse eid="PRO 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 25:10" />buleivo munhu yohulika kezakuguma chinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:10">na chinyala icho hachizamala.<verse eid="PRO 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 25:11" />Mbuli ilongigwa kwa lusita lufaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:11">ilinga fana mahambo ya zahabu muna ichiya cha hela.<verse eid="PRO 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 25:12" />Muhavu kuzumigwa na munhu mbala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:12">kufosa heleni na hambo da zahabu inogile.<verse eid="PRO 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 25:13" />Msenga yokwaminika komdeng'heleza ija yamtumile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:13">fana mazi yozizima lusita lwa vuke.<verse eid="PRO 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 25:14" />Munhu yoitogola kwa vitumetume havilava,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:14">kalinga fana mawingu na beho dilibule mvula.<verse eid="PRO 25:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 25:15" />Uhafunya umoyo kodaha kumtenda mtawala yatogole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:15">mbuli zinogile zodaha kugalula magesa ya munhu yolema kutegeleza.<verse eid="PRO 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 25:16" />One uhapata uki, diya wa kukufaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:16">uhaja ng'hani kwizadeka.<verse eid="PRO 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 25:17" />Sekewingile muna ikaye ya mkaya miyago chila lusita,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:17">muladi sekeyakulegele na kukuwonela ludoko.<verse eid="PRO 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 25:18" />Munhu yomulavila usindila wa uvwizi mkaya miyage,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:18">kalinga fana lungu na panga na msale ukutwa.<verse eid="PRO 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 25:19" />Kumuhuwila munhu yeli siyo mwaminika uhawa muna uuzidilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:19">kulinga fana kuhuwila zino diwolile hebu mgulu usiguke.<verse eid="PRO 25:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 25:20" />Munhu yomwimbila munhu yafile moyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:20">kalinga fana munhu yohambula mawalo yake siku ya mbeho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:20">na kalinga fana siki itiligwe muna ichilonda.<verse eid="PRO 25:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 25:21" />One mwihi wako yahawa na nzala, mwing'he ndiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:21">na yahawa na ng'hilu, mwing'he mazi.<verse eid="PRO 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 25:22" />Kwa kutenda vino, komuhalila munhu iyo makala ya moto muna iditwi jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:22">nayo Mndewa Mulungu kezakugweka.<verse eid="PRO 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 25:23" />Lulimi lulonga udelenya volugala ludoko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:23">lulinga fana beho da kasikazi vodigala mvula.<verse eid="PRO 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 25:24" />Muhavu kukala kuna ichisuwili cha kaye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:24">kufosa kukala kaye imwe na muke yeli na ndwagi.<verse eid="PRO 25:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 25:25" />Mbuli inogile yoilawa kuna iisi ya kutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:25">ilinga fana mazi ya mbeho kwa munhu yeli na ng'hilu.<verse eid="PRO 25:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 25:26" />Munhu yotenda mbuli zinogile viyohumigwa na wihi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:26">kalinga fana nzasa itibuligwe hebu chisima chili na mazi yatibuke.<verse eid="PRO 25:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 25:27" />Havinogile kuja uki mwingi ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:27">na havinogile kulonda kutogozigwa.<verse eid="PRO 25:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 25:28" />Munhu hadaha kuikimilila mwenyewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 25:28">kalinga fana bululu dilibule wakalizi.<verse eid="PRO 25:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="PRO 26" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 26:1" />Wabozi hawafaya kuhishimigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 26:1">fana viili haifaya zuwa lusita lwa mvula na mvula lusita lwa kugobola.<verse eid="PRO 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 26:2" />Kuduwiligwa hakumpata munhu bila chimu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 26:2">fana chinega viyoguluka bila kwima.<verse eid="PRO 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 26:3" />Balati kwa falasi, zabi kwa chihongwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 26:3">na balati muna imigongo ya wanhu wabozi.<verse eid="PRO 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 26:4" />Sekeuwedike wanhu wabozi kwa ubozi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 26:4">muladi sekeulinge fana wawo.<verse eid="PRO 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 26:5" />Wedike wanhu wabozi kwa ubozi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 26:5">buleivo wezaiwona wabala.<verse eid="PRO 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 26:6" />Kuwatuma wasenga wabozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 26:6">kulinga fana kuudumula umgulu hebu kuja daka.<verse eid="PRO 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 26:7" />Simwe muna imilomo ya wanhu wabozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 26:7">zilinga fana migulu ya mbetembete.<verse eid="PRO 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 26:8" />Kuwahishimu wanhu wabozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 26:8">kulinga fana kwika mbwewe muna ing'humbwewe.<verse eid="PRO 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 26:9" />Simwe muna imilomo ya wanhu wabozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 26:9">zilinga fana miwa muna yamakono ya wanhu wakoligwe.<verse eid="PRO 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 26:10" />Wanhu woweng'ha sang'hano wanhu wabozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 26:10">walinga fana wanhu wopigisa upinde wolumiza chakachaka.<verse eid="PRO 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 26:11" />Wanhu wabozi wobwelela ubozi wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 26:11">walinga fana zimbwa vizija madesi yawo.<verse eid="PRO 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 26:12" />Wanhu wabozi wodaha kuhuwila ng'hani kufosa wanhu woiwona wabala.<verse eid="PRO 26:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 26:13" />Wanhu wabwa wolonga, “Mzila muna simba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 26:13">simba mkali kozunguluka muna zikaye.”<verse eid="PRO 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 26:14" />Wanhu wabwa woihindula muna yamakomwa yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 26:14">walinga fana lwivi voluhinda na voluvuguka.<verse eid="PRO 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 26:15" />Wanhu wamwenga wabwa ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 26:15">mbaka hawadaha kuja wenyewo.<verse eid="PRO 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 26:16" />Wanhu wabwa woiwona kuwa wabala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 26:16">kufosa wanhu saba wokwidika kwa umanyi.<verse eid="PRO 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 26:17" />Munhu yokwingilila ugomvi si wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 26:17">kalinga fana munhu yomwamha magutwi imbwa yofosa.<verse eid="PRO 26:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 26:18" />Fana mtachichala viyodalila miwenge ya moto hebu misale ikoma,<verse eid="PRO 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 26:19" />niivo viyeli munhu yomvwizila miyage na kulonga, “Nikala nokwinzikila.”<verse eid="PRO 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 26:20" />One habule ngodi moto wozimika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 26:20">na ugomvi womala one habule munhu wa kukong'hela.<verse eid="PRO 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 26:21" />Wanhu weli na ndwagi wokong'hela ndwagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 26:21">walinga fana wanhu wokongeza makala muna yamakala yokwaka na ngodi muna umoto.<verse eid="PRO 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 26:22" />Mbuli za wadesi zilinga fana ndiya zili mulile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 26:22">zokwingila mgati ng'hani mwa lukuli.<verse eid="PRO 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 26:23" />Wanhu wolonga mbuli zinogile mbali mizoyo yawo iha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 26:23">walinga fana langi inogile ihakigwe muna ivia va ulongo.<verse eid="PRO 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 26:24" />Wanhu wowehila wamwenga wofisa wihi muna imilomo yawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 26:24">mbali muna imizoyo yawo wofisa uvwizi.<verse eid="PRO 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 26:25" />Wahalonga mbuli zinogile sekeuwahuwile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 26:25">kwaviya muna imizoyo yawo wogesa mbuli zihile nyingi.<verse eid="PRO 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 26:26" />Lungilo jawo da kuwatenda vihile wanhu wamwenga dofisigwa na uvwizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 26:26">mbali mbuli zawo zihile zizalagusigwa hana umting'hano.<verse eid="PRO 26:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 26:27" />Wanhu wahahimba kombo wezakwingila umo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 26:27">wanhu wahabimbilisa dibwe dizawabwelela na kuwahonda.<verse eid="PRO 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 26:28" />Lulimi lulonga uvwizi lowehila waja louwalumiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 26:28">mulomo wa kuhembeleza kwa uvwizi wonanga.<verse eid="PRO 26:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="PRO 27" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 27:1" />Sekeuigodele mbuli zondazilawilile igolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:1">kwaviya huvimanyile igolo chizalawilila choni.<verse eid="PRO 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 27:2" />Leka wanhu wamwenga wakutogoze, mbali siyo weye mwenyewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:2">wanhu wamwenga watende ivo, mbali siyo mulomo wako.<verse eid="PRO 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 27:3" />Dibwe dizama na msanga uzama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:3">mbali kugumigwa ludoko na wabozi watatali kuzama kufosa vinhu ivo vose.<verse eid="PRO 27:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 27:4" />Ludoko ni usede na ng'hasiliki ni mvula ya gombo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:4">mbali yelihi yodaha kwima haulongozi wa wanhu wowona migongo?<verse eid="PRO 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 27:5" />Muhavu munhu yokukalikila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:5">kufosa ulondo uifisile.<verse eid="PRO 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 27:6" />Mbwiya wahakukalikila wolagusa kuwa wokulonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:6">mbali wehi wahakusangalalila kukulamsa wolagusa udelenya.<verse eid="PRO 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 27:7" />Wanhu wokwiguta hawalonda uki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:7">mbali wanhu weli na nzala hata chinhu chili usungu wochiwona chamulile.<verse eid="PRO 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 27:8" />Wanhu wokala kutali na kaye zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:8">walinga fana ndege weli kutali na mvulu zawo.<verse eid="PRO 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 27:9" />Mavuta na vinhu vinung'hila goya voudeng'heleza moyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:9">iviya umbwiya wa munhu wolawa muna yamagesa yake yanogile.<verse eid="PRO 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 27:10" />Sekeumuleke mbwiyako hebu mbwiya wa tati yako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:10">iviya uhawa na ndilo sekewingile muna ikaye ya ndugu yako lusita kahabule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:10">kwaviya muhavu mkaya miyago kufosa ndugu yeli kutali.<verse eid="PRO 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 27:11" />Mwanangu, uwe mbala muladi udeng'heleze moyo wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:11">maabaho nodaha kumwidika munhu yoyose yonilonga vihile.<verse eid="PRO 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 27:12" />Wanhu weli na nzewele wahawona ng'hondo woifisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:12">mbali wanhu hawavimanyile wogendelela kuulongozi na ng'hondo iyo yowagaza.<verse eid="PRO 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 27:13" />Sola walo da munhu yomwikila zamana munhu hammanyile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:13">ujamhilile diwe lehani kwa ichimu cha munhu iyo.<verse eid="PRO 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 27:14" />One munhu yoyose yahamtemela mate mkaya miyage chilochilo kwa dizi kulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:14">izapeteka fana duwilo.<verse eid="PRO 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 27:15" />Muke yolongelela ulwo kwa ulwo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:15">kalinga fana madwende ya mvula yogendelela.<verse eid="PRO 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 27:16" />Kumkimilila ilinga fana kuikimilila mbeho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:16">na ilinga fana kwamha mavuta muna diganza jako.<verse eid="PRO 27:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 27:17" />Munhu koifunza kwa munhu imwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:17">fana viya chuma vichinoligwa na chuma chimwenga.<verse eid="PRO 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 27:18" />Munhu youlola goya mtini kezakuja matunda yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:18">na munhu yomulola goya mwenevale wake kezahishimigwa.<verse eid="PRO 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 27:19" />Fana voudaha kuwona chihanga chako muna yamazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:19">niivo moyo wa munhu womulagusa viyeli.<verse eid="PRO 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 27:20" />Ifa na kunanga haviguta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:20">iviya meso ya wanhu hayeguta.<verse eid="PRO 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 27:21" />Unovu wa hela na zahabu wogezigwa kwa moto,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:21">na wanhu wahatogozigwa womanyika viweli.<verse eid="PRO 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 27:22" />Hata uhamdunda mbozi mtatali muna dituli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:22">uhamtwanga na mtoho fana uhule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:22">hwizasegeza ubozi wake.<verse eid="PRO 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 27:23" />Iyohe kuyamanya mabumbila yako ya ng'hondolo viyeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:23">na kuwalola ng'hani ng'ombe wako,<verse eid="PRO 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 27:24" />kwaviya utajili haukala siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:24">na kombelo hadikala nyelesi zose.<verse eid="PRO 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 27:25" />Mayani yanyalile yahalimigwa na yamwenga yahota,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:25">mayani kulawa kuna imilima yoiduganya,<verse eid="PRO 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 27:26" />wanang'hondolo wolava mazoya ya kusonela mawalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:26">na uhachuuza luti kwizapata hela ya kugula migunda.<verse eid="PRO 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 27:27" />Iviya kwizakung'wa maziwa mengi ya luti wamwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 27:27">kwa ichimu chako na kaye yako na wasang'hani wako wa chike.<verse eid="PRO 27:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="PRO 28" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 28:1" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wokimbila ingawa habule munhu yowawinga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:1">mbali wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile magalu fana simba.<verse eid="PRO 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 28:2" />Isi ihawa na tibwilitibwili wolawilila walangulizi wengi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:2">mbali isi ili na walangulizi wabala izagangamala.<verse eid="PRO 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 28:3" />Munhu ngayengaye yomwehula munhu ngayengaye ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:3">kalinga fana mvula ng'hulu yoidanganya ndiya.<verse eid="PRO 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 28:4" />Wanhu woyalema malagilizo wowatogola wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:4">mbali wanhu wozindilila malagilizo wowalema wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile.<verse eid="PRO 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 28:5" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile hawamanyile kuhumiza voilondeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:5">mbali wanhu womzahila Mndewa Mulungu wovimanya goya.<verse eid="PRO 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 28:6" />Muhavu ngayengaye wolonga ukweli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:6">kufosa matajili wadelenya.<verse eid="PRO 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 28:7" />Wana wozindilila malagilizo wana nzewele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:7">mbali wambwiya wa wamelo wowaguma chinyala tati zawo.<verse eid="PRO 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 28:8" />Wanhu wokongeza utajili wawo kwa limangwe kulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:8">mbali wanhu wowawonela ubazi ngayengaye wezapata utajili wa wanhu wawo.<verse eid="PRO 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 28:9" />One wanhu wahalema kutegeleza malagilizo ya Mulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:9">chiya chiwopula chomwihiza Mulungu.<verse eid="PRO 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 28:10" />Munhu yowalongoza muna inzila ihile wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:10">kezakugwa muna dikombo jake mwenyewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:10">mbali wanhu welibule ubananzi wezahokela uhazi unogile.<verse eid="PRO 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 28:11" />Wanhu matajili wogesa kuwa wabala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:11">mbali ngayengaye weli na umanyi wowamanya wanhu weli na vinhu vingi viweli.<verse eid="PRO 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 28:12" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wahahuma, wanhu wamwenga wosangalala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:12">mbali wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wahatawala, wanhu wamwenga wezaifisa.<verse eid="PRO 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 28:13" />Wanhu woufisa uhasanyi wawo, hawezakala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:13">mbali wanhu wosama uhasanyi wawo na kuleka, wezawoneligwa ubazi.<verse eid="PRO 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 28:14" />Kamweda munhu ija yomdumba Mndewa Mulungu siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:14">mbali munhu youtenda moyo wake kuwa mdala kezapata magayo.<verse eid="PRO 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 28:15" />Munhu mwihi yowatawala ngayengaye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:15">kalinga fana simba yotongoloma hebu dubu yeli na nzala.<verse eid="PRO 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 28:16" />Mulangulizi mbozi kowawonela ng'hani wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:16">mbali munhu halonda kuwabamanya wamwenga kezatawala miyaka mingi.<verse eid="PRO 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 28:17" />Wanhu wogazigwa na ubananzi wa kukoma munhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:17">wezaifisa mbaka siku zawo za kudanganika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:17">mbali munhu yoyose sekeyawataze.<verse eid="PRO 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 28:18" />Wanhu wokala voilondeka wezakala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:18">mbali wanhu wavwizi wezanangigwa kwa kusinhukiza.<verse eid="PRO 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 28:19" />Wanhu wolima migunda yawo wezakuwa na ndiya nyingi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:19">mbali wanhu wotenda mbuli za chakachaka wezakuwa ngayengaye ng'hani.<verse eid="PRO 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 28:20" />Wanhu waminika wezatemeligwa mate ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:20">mbali wanhu wolonda kupata utajili wa himahima wezatagusigwa.<verse eid="PRO 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 28:21" />Kuwabagula wanhu hakunogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:21">wanhu wezatenda mbuli zihile muladi wapate chihande cha gate.<verse eid="PRO 28:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 28:22" />Wanhu wagila womelela mate kupata utajili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:22">mbali hawavimanyile kuwa ungayengaye wowezila.<verse eid="PRO 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 28:23" />Wanhu wowazuma wayawo wezatogozigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:23">kufosa wanhu weli na mbuli za kuhembeleza kwa uvwizi.<verse eid="PRO 28:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 28:24" />Munhu yombawila tati yake hebu mami yake na kulonga, “Siyo ubananzi,”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:24">iyo koilumba na wasede.<verse eid="PRO 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 28:25" />Wanhu wagila wokong'hela ndwagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:25">mbali wanhu womuhuwila Mndewa Mulungu wezakala goya.<verse eid="PRO 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 28:26" />Wanhu wohuwila nzewele zawo ni wabozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:26">mbali wabala wezakala moyo hole.<verse eid="PRO 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 28:27" />Wanhu wowagolela ngayengaye hawezahungukilwa na chinhu chochose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:27">mbali wanhu wowehula ngayengaye wezaduwiligwa ng'hani.<verse eid="PRO 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 28:28" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wahatawala, wanhu wamwenga woifisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 28:28">mbali wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wahaleka kutawala, wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wokala goya.<verse eid="PRO 28:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="PRO 29" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 29:1" />Wanhu wozumigwa miyanza mingi na wang'hali wana mizoyo midala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 29:1">wezanangigwa kwa kusinhukila na hawezahona.<verse eid="PRO 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 29:2" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wahatawala, wanhu wamwenga wodeng'helela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 29:2">mbali wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wahatawala, wanhu wamwenga wolongelela.<verse eid="PRO 29:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 29:3" />Wabala wowadeng'heleza tati zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 29:3">mbali wanhu woilumba na malaya wezakwagiza vinhu vawo.<verse eid="PRO 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 29:4" />Mfalume kogangamiza isi kwa kuhumiza voilondeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 29:4">mbali munhu yohokela lushwa koibananga isi.<verse eid="PRO 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 29:5" />Wanhu wowatogoza wakaya wayawo muladi wapate chiwolonda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 29:5">wotanda nyavu muladi kutega magulu yawo.<verse eid="PRO 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 29:6" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wogwiligwa na uhasanyi wawo wenyewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 29:6">mbali wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wodaha kwimba na kudeng'helela.<verse eid="PRO 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 29:7" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wolonda ngayengaye wahumizigwe voilondeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 29:7">mbali wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile hawagesa kutenda ivo.<verse eid="PRO 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 29:8" />Wanhu wowehula wayawo wokong'hela ndwagi muna dibululu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 29:8">mbali wabala wohoza ludoko.<verse eid="PRO 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 29:9" />Wanhu wabala wahahita kuna ichitala na wabozi watatali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 29:9">wabozi wokalika na woseka, baho habule mulile.<verse eid="PRO 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 29:10" />Wanhu wokoma wayawo womwihila munhu yotenda mbuli zinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 29:10">na wolonda kumkoma munhu goya.<verse eid="PRO 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 29:11" />Wanhu wabozi wolagusa ludoko lwawo lose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 29:11">mbali wanhu wabala woikimilila.<verse eid="PRO 29:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 29:12" />Mulangulizi yahamtegeleza munhu mvwizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 29:12">vinyandama wake wose wokuwa wahasanya.<verse eid="PRO 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 29:13" />Ngayengaye na wanhu wowonela woilinga kwa mbuli ino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 29:13">Mndewa Mulungu kawatenda wose wadahe kulola.<verse eid="PRO 29:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 29:14" />One mfalume yahawahumiza ngayengaye voilondeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 29:14">chigoda chake cha chifalume chizagangamizigwa siku zose.<verse eid="PRO 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 29:15" />Balati na kuzumigwa vogala ubala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 29:15">mbali wana hawalamuligwa wowaguma chinyala mami zawo.<verse eid="PRO 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 29:16" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zihile wahongezeka na uhasanyi wokongezeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 29:16">mbali wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wezalola wanhu wawo viwonangigwa.<verse eid="PRO 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 29:17" />Uwalamule wanago muladi ukale moyo hole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 29:17">na wezakutenda udeng'helele.<verse eid="PRO 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 29:18" />Hanhu helibule ulotezi, wanhu woleka kuikimilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 29:18">mbali wamweda wanhu wozindilila malagilizo.<verse eid="PRO 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 29:19" />Haidahika msang'hani kulamuligwa kwa mbuli muhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 29:19">kwaviya kavimanya mbali hezategeleza.<verse eid="PRO 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 29:20" />Uhawawona wanhu wohanja,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 29:20">wanhu wabozi wana muhavu kufosa wawo.<verse eid="PRO 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 29:21" />Munhu yahamnyeng'hemeza msang'hani wake kwandusila yang'hali mbwanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 29:21">hamwande msang'hani iyo kezamtenda yagaye.<verse eid="PRO 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 29:22" />Wanhu weli na ludoko wokong'hela ndwagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 29:22">na wanhu weli na ng'hasiliki wotenda uhasanyi.<verse eid="PRO 29:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 29:23" />Magoda ya wanhu yowagalila chinyala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 29:23">mbali wanhu woinyendanyenda wezahishimigwa.<verse eid="PRO 29:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 29:24" />Munhu yoilumba na mbavi kokuwa mwihi wa muhe wake mwenyewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 29:24">na halonga ukweli kuna ichitala.<verse eid="PRO 29:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 29:25" />Kuwadumba wanhu ni kwiitegela mtego wenyewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 29:25">mbali wanhu womuhuwila Mndewa Mulungu wezakala moyo hole.<verse eid="PRO 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 29:26" />Wanhu wengi wolonda kugesigwa na watawala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 29:26">mbali Mndewa Mulungu kowahumiza wanhu voilondeka.<verse eid="PRO 29:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 29:27" />Wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile wowehila wabamanyi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 29:27">na wanhu wehi wowehila ng'hani wanhu wotenda mbuli zinogile.<verse eid="PRO 29:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="PRO 30" />
  <para style="s">Masimwe ya Aguli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 30:1" />Aguli mwana wa Yake kolonga mbuli zino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:1">kowalongela mbuli zino Isieli na Ukali,<verse eid="PRO 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 30:2" />“Kweli na mbozi kufosa wanhu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:2">na nabule umanyi wa chiunhu.<verse eid="PRO 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 30:3" />Siifunzile ubala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:3">na simmanyile Mulungu yelile.<verse eid="PRO 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 30:4" />Yelihi yakwelile kuulanga na kuhulumuka?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:4">Yelihi yokunzagiza beho kwa makono yake?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:4">Yelihi yafungile mazi muna diwalo jake?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:4">Yelihi yagangamize mhaka za isi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:4">Yeye kotangigwa vilihi na mwanage kotangigwa vilihi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:4">One uhavimanya nilongele!<verse eid="PRO 30:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 30:5" />Chila mbuli ya Mulungu yofaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:5">yeye kalinga fana kingilo kwa waja womkimbilila.<verse eid="PRO 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 30:6" />Sekeongeze mbuli muna zimbuli zake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:6">buleivo kezakulamula na kukulagusa kuwa kwamvwizi.<verse eid="PRO 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 30:7" />Weye Mndewa Mulungu, nikupula vinhu vidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:7">sekeunime ning'hali sinadanganika.<verse eid="PRO 30:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 30:8" />Unisegezele uvwizi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:8">sekeunitende niwe ngayengaye hebu tajili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:8">mbali uning'he ndiya yangu ya chila siku.<verse eid="PRO 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 30:9" />Buleivo nizakuwa na vinhu vingi na kukuleka na kulonga, ‘Mndewa Mulungu iyo yelihi?’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:9">Iviya nizakuwa ngayengaye na kubawa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:9">na kudiguma chinyala zina da Mulungu wangu.<verse eid="PRO 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 30:10" />Sekeumulongeleze msang'hani kwa mwenevale wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:10">muladi sekeyakuduwile na uwoneke kubananga.<verse eid="PRO 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 30:11" />Kuna wanhu wowaduwila tati zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:11">na wanhu hawawatemela mate mami zawo.<verse eid="PRO 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 30:12" />Wanhu woigesa kuwa wela</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:12">mbali hawanasafyigwa.<verse eid="PRO 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 30:13" />Kuna wanhu wamwenga wadugi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:13">wokwehula chila chinhu.<verse eid="PRO 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 30:14" />Kuna wanhu wamwenga meno yawo yalinga fana mapanga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:14">na saya zawo zikigwa myele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:14">muladi kuwagegeda ngayengaye muna iisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:14">na kuwananga wanhu wolonda kutazigwa.<verse eid="PRO 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 30:15" />Luba kana wandele waidi, wolonga, ‘Ning'he,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:15">Kuna vinhu vimwenga haviguta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:15">kuna vine havilonga, ‘Yofaya.’<verse eid="PRO 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 30:16" />Vinhu ivo votangigwa kuzimu na munda wa mwanamke heleka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:16">na isi haimema mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:16">na moto haulonga, ‘Yofaya.’<verse eid="PRO 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 30:17" />Munhu yahamzeha tati yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:17">na kwehula kumtegeleza mami yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:17">mahowe wa kudikolongo wezamdomola yameso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:17">na kezadigwa na masumula.<verse eid="PRO 30:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 30:18" />Kuna vinhu vimwenga vonyazanya ng'hani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:18">na kuna vine sivimanyile.<verse eid="PRO 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 30:19" />Vinhu ivo votangigwa ugenzi wa masumula kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:19">na ugenzi wa nyoka muna uluwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:19">na ugenzi wa meli muna ibahali ng'hulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:19">na ugenzi wa munhu yeli hamwe na mhambe.<verse eid="PRO 30:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 30:20" />Uno uwo ugenzi wa muke mzinzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:20">koibandama na mulume, maabaho kokoga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:20">na kolonga, ‘Sitendile mbuli yoyose ihile.’<verse eid="PRO 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 30:21" />Isi yogudemeka kwa mbuli zimwenga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:21">kweli haidaha kuvifunyila umoyo vinhu vine.<verse eid="PRO 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 30:22" />Vinhu ivo votangigwa mtumwa yokuwa mfalume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:22">na mbozi yokwiguta ndiya,<verse eid="PRO 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 30:23" />na muke halondigwa voyosoligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:23">na msang'hani wa chike viyosola hanhu ha mwenevale wake wa chike.<verse eid="PRO 30:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 30:24" />Kuna vilumbe vidodo vine muna iisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:24">mbali vibala ng'hani.<verse eid="PRO 30:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 30:25" />Sungusungu ni vilumbe weli na nguvu ndodo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:25">mbali woikila ngama ya ndiya lusita lwa zuwa kali.<verse eid="PRO 30:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 30:26" />Ng'hulumbe ni vilumbe weli na nguvu ndodo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:26">mbali woizengela kaye zawo kuna imiluwe.<verse eid="PRO 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 30:27" />Nzige wabule mfalume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:27">mbali wogenda hamwe kwa vibumbila.<verse eid="PRO 30:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 30:28" />Kodaha kumwamha golombela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:28">mbali kopatika muna zikaye za chifalume.<verse eid="PRO 30:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 30:29" />Kuna vilumbe vimwenga vihagenda voguma mulile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:29">kuna vine vogenda kwa magoda.<verse eid="PRO 30:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 30:30" />Vilumbe ivo ni simba yeli hadumba chochose na kana nguvu kufosa wanyama wose,<verse eid="PRO 30:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 30:31" />na nzogolo yogenda kwa kuigoda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:31">na bebelu da luti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:31">na mfalume hamwe na wanhu wake.<verse eid="PRO 30:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PRO 30:32" />Uhatenda ubozi na kuinula mwenyewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:32">hebu one uhagesa mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:32">gubika mulomo wako kwa mkono.<verse eid="PRO 30:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PRO 30:33" />Kwaviya wanhu wahatingisa maziwa muna inyhupa wopata siagi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:33">na wahamtowa munhu muna imhula kolawa damu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 30:33">ivo wokong'hela ludoko wolawilila ndwagi.”<verse eid="PRO 30:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="PRO 31" />
  <para style="s">Masimwe ya mfalume Lemueli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PRO 31:1" />Mbuli za mfalume Lemueli, kafundizigwa na mami yake,<verse eid="PRO 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PRO 31:2" />Tegeleza mwanangu! Tegeleza mwana yonikweleke kulawa mwiinda yangu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:2">Tegeleza mwanangu yonikupulile kwa Mulungu.<verse eid="PRO 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PRO 31:3" />Sekeukomeleze nguvu zako kwa kuwangala wanaake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:3">moyo wako sekeuwahuwile wawo wowananga wafalume.<verse eid="PRO 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PRO 31:4" />Weye Lemueli, haifaya wafalume na walangulizi kung'wa divai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:4">na wakulu sekewaumelele mate upele.<verse eid="PRO 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PRO 31:5" />Wahang'wa upele, wezazimiza malagilizo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:5">na wezawabamanya wanhu wolonda kutazigwa.<verse eid="PRO 31:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PRO 31:6" />Weng'he upele wanhu weli habehi kudanganika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:6">weng'he divai wanhu weli na usungu ng'hani.<verse eid="PRO 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PRO 31:7" />Waleke wang'we na wazimize ungayengaye wawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:7">na sekewakumbuke kaidi usungu wawo.<verse eid="PRO 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PRO 31:8" />Longa kwa ichimu cha wanhu hawadaha kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:8">uwagombele wanhu wose welibule munhu wa kuwataza.<verse eid="PRO 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PRO 31:9" />Longa na uhumize voilondeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:9">uweng'he haki yawo ngayengaye na wolonda kutazigwa.<verse eid="PRO 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muke yeli na moyo unogile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PRO 31:10" />Vino yelihi yodaha kumpata muke yeli na moyo unogile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:10">Unovu wake wofosa vinhu va hela nyingi.<verse eid="PRO 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PRO 31:11" />Mulumake komuhuwila yeye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:11">na yeye hapuwa chinhu chochose chinogile.<verse eid="PRO 31:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PRO 31:12" />Yeye hamtendela mulumake mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:12">komtendela mbuli zinogile siku zose za ugima wake.<verse eid="PRO 31:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PRO 31:13" />Kosona mawalo ya sufu na chitani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:13">na koiyoha kusang'hana usang'hano kwa makono yake mwenyewo.<verse eid="PRO 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PRO 31:14" />Muke iyo kalinga fana meli za uchuuzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:14">kwaviya kogala ndiya kulawa kutali.<verse eid="PRO 31:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PRO 31:15" />Kolamka chilochilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:15">koweng'ha ndiya wanhu weli muna ikaye yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:15">na koweng'ha sang'hano wasang'hani wake wa chike.<verse eid="PRO 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PRO 31:16" />Kogesa kugula mgunda na maabaho kogula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:16">kosang'hanila hela zake kuhanda mizabibu.<verse eid="PRO 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PRO 31:17" />Kosang'hana sang'hano zake kwa nguvu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:17">na koyagangamiza makono yake.<verse eid="PRO 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PRO 31:18" />Kovimanya kuwa sang'hano zake zina faida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:18">kosang'hana sang'hano mbaka ichilo kwa bung'hulo da chitasa chake.<verse eid="PRO 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PRO 31:19" />Kohogosa nyuzi kwa makono yake mwenyewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:19">kosona mawalo yake kwa vidole vake.<verse eid="PRO 31:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PRO 31:20" />Kofungula makono yake koweng'ha vinhu vake ngayengaye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:20">kogolola mkono wake kuwataza wanhu wolonda kutazigwa.<verse eid="PRO 31:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PRO 31:21" />Chihuhwe chahafika, hadumba kwa ichimu cha wanhu wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:21">kwaviya wose kawavaza mawalo yazamile.<verse eid="PRO 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PRO 31:22" />Kosona migolole ya komwa jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:22">koyawala mawalo madung'hu ya chitani inogile.<verse eid="PRO 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PRO 31:23" />Mulumake kohishimigwa hana ulwivi lukulu lwa bululu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:23">viyokala uko hamwe na walala wa isi.<verse eid="PRO 31:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PRO 31:24" />Muke iyo kosona mawalo ya chitani na kuyachuuza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:24">kowachuuzila mikwiji wanhu wochuuza vinhu.<verse eid="PRO 31:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PRO 31:25" />Kokuwa na nguvu na hishima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:25">kodaha kuseka bila kudumba siku zikwiza.<verse eid="PRO 31:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PRO 31:26" />Kolonga kwa ubala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:26">na kowafunza wanhu kwa moyo umwe.<verse eid="PRO 31:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PRO 31:27" />Kolola mbuli zitendeka muna ikaye yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:27">siyo munhu mbwa.<verse eid="PRO 31:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PRO 31:28" />Wanage wolamka na womtogoza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:28">iviya mulumake komtogoza,<verse eid="PRO 31:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PRO 31:29" />kolonga, “Wanaake wengi wotenda vinhu vinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:29">mbali weye kuwahuma wose.”<verse eid="PRO 31:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PRO 31:30" />Kuihamba ng'hani ni uvwizi na unovu wa chihanga womala himahima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:30">mbali muke yomdumba Mndewa Mulungu kotogozigwa.<verse eid="PRO 31:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PRO 31:31" />Umgweke kwa sang'hano zake zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PRO 31:31">yatogozigwe hana ulwivi lukulu lwa bululu kwa sang'hano ziyatendile.<verse eid="PRO 31:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PRO 31" />
</usx>